window.SEARCH_INDEX = [{"s": 1, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-1.html#big-idea", "text": "Everything, including you, is made of one vibrating structure. Your thoughts, emotions and actions send out a frequency, and that frequency decides which reality you move into next. Keep sending the same frequency and you lock in a timeline. To change your life, change the frequency, hold it steadily, and let go of any expectation about how the result will come.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 1, "title": "1.1  Reality is one structure — and you are it", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-1", "text": "The universe is built from one single particle vibrating so fast that it appears next to itself, endlessly. Things with a similar frequency join into a plasma; similar plasmas join into a third (a trinity), and this repeats through the whole universe. Each plasma can hold an entire universe. At its centre is a black hole, which is the portal you use to move from one reality to another. You are made of this same structure. So nobody is outside of you — not a separate God in the sky, and in a sense not even other people, who appear as a hologram you project in order to have an experience. That hologram is made of frequency, sound, mantra and geometric patterns. Because the structure is everything, the teaching calls you the god particle, the universe and the quantum field. This is also where science and religion meet: \"religion, believe it or not, is science.\" Understood together, there is no need for separation or for different religions. The one particle \"in the beginning had no laws,\" so it vibrates at infinite speed and appears next to itself to infinity; this is why we are all one. When you look at someone, that someone is you through a different experience (HR). Trinity structures form toruses, and the black holes inside them are multidimensional portals in the universal magma (SD); two similar systems combine as 1 + 1 = 3 (SD, NT). The book adds that every planet, including Earth, has a black hole at its centre acting as a portal (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "title": "1.2  What you send out is what you get back", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-2", "text": "Every thought has a frequency, a sound and a geometric pattern. Your thoughts, emotions and deeds, together, form one broadcast — a trinity. That broadcast creates a parallel reality, and you shift into it. You don't move; you shift, like a snapshot jumping to the next frame. This is why whatever you put out comes back. All three must match. Positive words with doubt underneath, or positive thoughts with no action, is not one clear broadcast. The teaching is to send thoughts, emotions and deeds \"at the same time as a trinity, non-stop\" in the positive. Your reality is a mirror image of your energy and thoughts. To create a reality you must be its vibration, acting and projecting the frequency, emotion and deeds into your hologram (DP). \"We are not traveling or moving at all. We are simply popping in and out of parallel realities\" (HR, NT).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "title": "1.3  Timelines are built moment to moment", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-3", "text": "Each moment you shift into a reality that matches what you are sending. Send the same emotion over and over — sadness, for example — and every new reality is built on sadness. That chain is a timeline, and holding it is how it crystallizes (becomes solid). To change it, raise your thoughts and emotions to the positive and stay there, moment after moment, until the new timeline crystallizes. Higher-frequency timelines have less friction: things manifest easily. Lower ones feel \"like swimming underwater.\" Do \"steady positive implementation of your mind and feelings at all time\" (DP). New structures crystallize through \"repetition, repetition, repetition\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "title": "1.4  If you can imagine it, it already exists", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-4", "text": "A rule said to come from the extraterrestrials: you cannot imagine something unless its vibration already exists somewhere in the field. There is no time — all realities run at once, like a TV with every channel playing simultaneously. You don't see the one you want yet because it must be crystallized: take action and hold the frequency moment to moment. Because every reality is already running, there is nothing to worry about in switching realities. Which one you experience depends only on the frequency of your emotion, thought and deed.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "title": "1.5  Why the same things keep happening", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-5", "text": "The field works at 100%. A movie downloaded to 99% won't play. If you want something but doubt it, question it, or carry a picture of exactly how it must happen, that doubt or picture is also sent into the field — and it blocks the result. Your everyday brain can't see how the higher level will deliver, so don't try to script it. Know it, stay calm whatever you see, and manifest in the now. The three-dimensional brain is described as limited: it cannot work at the level of higher consciousness, which alone knows how things will happen. Every expectation hides a scenario of how it should go, and that scenario is a condition placed in the field. The goal is to stay calm, keep projecting the positive, and know that whatever happens is part of the process. The same DVD example appears in the book, with one addition: you must believe and feel at the same time, with the frequency of pure love, at 100%. It says manifestation happens only when there is no ego (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "title": "1.6  Your emotion is your compass", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-6", "text": "Your true nature, the teaching says, is pure love. So the moment you feel hurt, fear or doubt, that feeling is your higher self, speaking from the heart, showing you that you are off-balance with who you really are. The belief that you have no power was printed into you through indoctrination and manipulation. In reality you have all the power, because you are consciousness itself. What you see around you is a hologram that shows you your location in the field. If you don't recognise where you are, you can \"pop into\" a completely different reality without knowing it. This is why reacting matters so much. If you respond to a hard moment with the same negative emotion, you project the next hologram with the same Earth, the same person and the same problem, and it can end in disaster. Controlling your emotion is how you consciously create. The Method below is the practice.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "title": "1.7  Abundance and receiving", "url": "section-1.html#part-1-7", "text": "The teaching is that money is an illusion. Whether you need $1 or $1 million makes no difference: if you stay in the heart, without greed and without conditions, you receive exactly what you need through synchronicity. What blocks receiving is the ego's belief that you must have a lot in the bank to feel good. Ask honestly: am I homeless? hungry? without clothes? \"Then what do you need?\" Feeling that you already have everything, and that everything is perfect, is the frequency that receives. The practical tool is the hide-and-seek game: when something seems missing, pull out, give thanks, then know it is already there and go looking or take action. You are not searching because you hope; you are searching because you know. Watch the subtle drops too: receiving something and thinking \"only this much?\" lowers your frequency. Stay in joy. What you need can arrive as money, a donation or a gift. The money system is still part of the structure, so you accept help when it comes. And it doesn't matter how it arrives, even if another person was the route; that is still the structure answering you. \"Give without expectations. Look for the manifestation without resistance\" (DP, NT). Abundance comes from within, by being the abundance; to see all abundance, give all abundance (DP). Giving and sharing from the heart with nothing expected back is called Energy Philanthropy, and it replaces the monetary-timeline illusion with energy from the heart (DP). Profiting from humanity's pain is explicitly opposed (DP). The key line on this \"In a quantum structure, you don't have to see it to believe it, you have to know it in order to see it.\"", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "title": "The method", "url": "section-1.html#method", "text": "What to do when something goes wrong, or when you want something: Notice. A painful emotion is your higher self telling you you're off-balance (your true nature is pure love). Pull out. Step out of the scene. \"Pull out and know that you are the structure.\" Don't react with the same emotion. Calm down completely. Be grateful for what you already have. Don't reject what's in front of you; rejection comes back. Lift and project. Raise your emotion to positive; let your words, tone and actions match. Let go of the how. No script, no expectation of the outcome. Take action and hold it moment to moment, even if nothing changes at first. If you slip, go back to step 2.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 1, "title": "Why do some things take long and others are instant?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "Partly your own conditions (there is no time). Partly agreements and lessons: you may need to gain certain knowledge first, like completing a school year. Doing your lessons with excellence may speed it up, but isn't guaranteed.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "Can I ask for myself? How do I serve and still live abundantly?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "Yes — just not from greed. You are not separate from God; you create. Help and give from the heart. Keep the work that pays your bills, and beyond that do heart-based work daily for others; this \"platform\" shifts you toward abundance. It may arrive as money, a donation or a gift — don't tie it only to money, and don't attach conditions.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "How do I manifest without affecting other people?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "Others are part of your projection. Pull out, calm down, be grateful, then imagine what you want without expectations. If someone is upset with you, answer kindly and without judgment (\"I understand you're upset — can we talk later?\") and keep that tone even if they don't change. Accept any outcome. If someone manipulates you, don't attack back — learn the lesson and step away; what they did stays in their reality.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "How do I create consciously?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "By controlling your emotion — the Method above. The belief that you lack power was taught to you; you have all of it.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "How do I know if something is a soul agreement or something I can change?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "In the example of a child's illness, the guidance was: \"It's a lesson. Accept this step.\" If it's an agreement, you can't skip it: accept it and pass it with excellence — do your best, from the heart, and learn what it teaches (that meant studying nutrition and much more). The knowledge may later help others. Healing came, but it took time.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "Is manifestation materialising or attraction?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "The same thing: similar frequencies attract and form matching realities.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "How do I stop repeating the same patterns?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "A pattern repeats until you pass its lesson 100% — until there's no friction left. Expecting it to repeat is itself a projection, so don't doubt yourself.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "How do I know my mission?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "You're always on it. Write down what you love, pick what excites you most, and follow that passion without thinking about the outcome.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "Do tools like binaural beats help?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "They're a permission slip — something that helps you calm down and connect. The power is yours, not the tool's.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "How can we lift all of humanity?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "Others are on their own paths and agreements, some hard ones (war is given as an example) that help the rest wake up and unite. Your part is to follow your passion — donate, help, join peace gatherings — which creates the Earth you live in.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "My ears ring. What do I do?", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "Don't fear it; it is seen as sensitivity to new frequencies. The real lesson: the same event has two possible realities. Believe you're under attack and you live that; see it as part of your growth and you live that. \"Which one you pick is up to you.\"", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 1, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-1.html#remember", "text": "• You are the structure. What you send out comes back. • Change the frequency, then hold it — moment to moment. • Know it 100%. No doubts, no script of how. • Act. Be grateful. Accept any outcome. • \"You don't have to see it to believe it — you have to know it in order to see it.\"", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 1, "title": "Questions answered", "url": "section-1.html#questions", "text": "(A question on ley lines was not answered.)", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-2.html#big-idea", "text": "Before you react, pull out to zero point: go still and neutral, and see where you are in the field. From there you choose the next frequency on purpose. You shift through realities that are similar in frequency, and each two merge into a third (1 + 1 = 3). That third reality takes on whatever emotion you held most. So don't fight or reject what you see. Overwrite it: choose the positive, amplify it until it is potent, hold it, then release it with no expectations.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.1  Zero point — stillness and knowing where you are", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-1", "text": "The talk revisits the one particle (see 1.1) and adds that it is also a nano particle: it expands, like breathing, and when it collapses it reaches the zero point. Zero point is stillness: no frequency coming in and no frequency going out. It is pure awareness of your location in the quantum field. The TV picture from 1.4 is extended: imagine sitting in front of many screens at once, each a reality you exist in. Which one you experience depends on your emotion, deeds and actions; they are your remote control. To use it well you first pull out and sit back in front of the screens, still, and check where you are. Knowing your location matters because if you don't, you \"pop out\" into a completely different reality or timeline without knowing where you are (see 1.6). Once you know your location, the next frequency you send from that awareness creates the next reality. Neutrality \"is the one that is giving you to choose with a clear mind\" the next frequency to project. You localize and stabilize in zero point, creating a \"vacuum of stillness,\" so you can shift and choose the new reality. Without it you live in \"constant duality, a constant battle of two or more realities\" (SD, the \"Mobilizing Structures\" chapter, which this talk reads from). Zero point is also called the heart structure \"where there is no conditions for manifestation\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.2  Mobilizing structures: 1 + 1 = 3", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-2", "text": "You are always shifting from one reality to the next and reprinting everything around you each time. Two realities, one after the other, are similar but never exactly the same in frequency. To manifest, they must be similar enough to merge. When they merge, they form a third reality: 1 + 1 = 3, the trinity (see 1.1). Your emotion decides the merge. If you are happy and then drop into doubt, your energy field switches so sharply that you fall into a different reality, and the next one is built on the negative. If instead you stay steady and keep reacting positively, even while the other person stays negative, you override the negative moment by moment. The two timelines become one positive unit. Both timelines co-exist; you move between them by choosing. That choice is made from zero point. Without it, shifting is random, because uncontrolled emotion keeps dropping you into denser realities. Emotion gives the frequency to the next reality, and your deed (action) infuses it. If two parallel realities are not similar in resonance they \"can not merge as one\"; you must level the field so that no new frequency is given, then choose (SD). Two systems combine \"1 + 1 = 3\" (SD, NT).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.3  Doubt makes you flicker", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-3", "text": "Doubt doesn't just pause you; it makes you bounce nonstop between two realities, like a waveform, so fast you can't tell where you're going. The quantum field never makes a mistake, so eventually it picks one: the one you infused more. If you spent more of the day in doubt, the third reality comes out negative, even if you didn't notice. Whatever emotion you stay in most, through the day and in your reactions, becomes the outcome. Fluctuating realities switch so quickly they cannot collapse into one, because they cannot hold the steady frequency of the heart (DP). Any doubt projects a holographic reality that mimics that doubt (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.4  Neutral is for hard moments — joy is not to be suppressed", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-4", "text": "Zero point means being neutral in a disturbing situation: not giving or taking emotion, just observing. It does not mean holding back joy. When you feel joy, keep going: each next shift is again joy, and you build a joyful timeline. The new frequencies arriving now, the talk says, come from the fifth dimension and above, are positive, and can activate your DNA. The more positive you are, the more positive you see.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.5  Other people's projections are not your truth", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-5", "text": "What you are shown, especially in the news, is a projection of someone else's timeline placed on top of you. Watch it over and over and you start to believe it; once you believe it 100%, it manifests for you. Instead, be aware: \"That's what they're projecting. Good for them. Love and light.\" The example is a storm forecast. Instead of accepting it, project that the weather is beautiful and keep doing so even if the sky is dark or rain starts. Give gratitude even for the rain: gratitude neutralizes what you see, bringing you to zero, so your new frequency can override it. The alternative is fluctuating into doubt because someone else told you what would happen. Language matters: say \"I know\", not \"I will\". \"Will\" keeps you waiting; manifestation is in the now. Also follow the money: if something is truly for humanity, it comes through the heart, not at a high price.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.6  Overwrite — don't reject, don't \"delete\"", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-6", "text": "You cannot delete a negative thought by rejecting it, because what you see is part of the structure, and you are the structure (see 1.1). You \"delete\" it through neutrality: \"I understand you're there. Thank you for showing me where I'm at in the quantum field.\" Then project a new, stronger frequency over it. You are not rejecting it; you are overriding it. The guidance is to make the new frequency potent. When told \"Action!\" like an actor, switch your emotion to positive and keep increasing the joy until you have goosebumps or tears. Like a stronger dose of medicine, it has to be stronger than the dense frequency it replaces. Then hold it, and finally to drop it: release it into the field so the consciousness you're made of can crystallize it. Dropping it matters because holding on adds conditions. With no conditions, \"Pandora's box is open\" and you receive everything you need. In the example given, the whole day turned out positive. Release the specifics too. Imagine the big picture without scripting it (the example: humanity living in beautiful cities, with free energy and benevolent extraterrestrials) and keep holding it, even when you hear negative news.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.7  Every moment is a brand-new reality", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-7", "text": "When you fall off the timeline you wanted and then rise again, you don't return to the old one: you create a brand new reality, and every moment does the same. That's why you can let go of past sorrow: it has nothing to do with the new you projected into the field. A timeline you held long enough can crystallize so differently that you no longer remember someone from an old one. What you repeat, you build. A constant diet of violent films or games feeds a timeline similar to it, which is why the advice is not to let children consume a lot of negative content. You also need recall. Each new hologram reprints the frequencies of the last one so you know where you are. When you walk into a room and forget why, you have shifted so fast you lost the frequency. The method: recall the previous room's frequency — where you were, what you were thinking, doing or saying — and the memory returns. \"Do not hold your previous emotions. It is irrelevant,\" because each parallel universe you shift into exists for itself, in the now (SD). Night dreams and waking life are both dreams; you only shift perception, and \"everything is NOW\" (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.8  Ascension: your own, and always positive", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-8", "text": "This reality is described as a dream state of consciousness that feels real, like touching something in a dream. Raising your consciousness shifts you to another timeline. Contact with extraterrestrials works the same way: your reality and theirs merge into a third, which needs similar frequencies held steady. Consciousness cannot exist in the negative only; it would disengage. So persistent negativity eventually dissipates, and people who stay negative meet realities that push them to stop. Each person makes their own ascension: be kind, share and give, and you match the less dense fifth-dimensional structures. Choose greed and negativity, and you project into a dense timeline, \"underwater\" instead of above it (see 1.3). In ascension \"all the dirt\" comes to the surface because it can't match 5D. Don't hate those exposed; it is their level of consciousness. Give gratitude that it came out. Without seeing the negative you couldn't choose the positive. It is a classroom: learn the lesson and move on. Love is the highest frequency; fear, hatred, jealousy and revenge are lower and trap you in a lower hologram of wars and destruction. A negative, materialistic or ego-driven person will see that reflected (HR). \"You are dreaming the ascension but you already made it\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.9  Affirmations, ego and peeling the layers", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-9", "text": "Affirmations work when stated in the now: \"I am fine,\" \"I am great.\" \"I'm going to be fine\" is false language that keeps you waiting. Say it knowing it 100%, so your frequency stops fluctuating, even if others say otherwise. But watch the ego. Affirming \"I'm perfect\" to dismiss someone's fair feedback is ego. Peel the layers: why do I really want this? Is it from my heart or my ego? Do I want to talk to one person, or a thousand because it makes me feel important? Ego is dense and built on false pretense. The heart's vibration is consciousness itself, which is why heart-based manifestation can be instant, while conditions slow it. We are perfect in the structure, but confused and manipulated. You will be tested, and what counts is how you behave towards people. When you slip into ego, you will be corrected: shift to gratitude and drop expectations towards people and situations. \"The Ego structure is lowering your vibrational signal.\" Do not try to profit from others; abundance comes in any form, not only money (DP, NT).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "2.10  When people stay negative", "url": "section-2.html#part-2-10", "text": "Talk it through and try to change the situation. If it doesn't change, pull out and choose where you want to be, so you keep your integrity. It hurts because you care. But don't hate: hatred is a false pretense too. Love the person, who is out of balance, and offer help. If they refuse it, put your energy into people who are ready. \"Make your own world.\" On money (see 1.7): pay your bills and do your work. But don't let \"how can I make money from this person?\" sit behind your help. Give from the heart and what you need can arrive. The talk closes by saying this is shared as one truth: you choose what to create.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "The method — the Overwrite Protocol", "url": "section-2.html#method", "text": "Use it the moment you notice a negative emotion, a disturbing scene, or someone else's projection: Notice the drop. \"I recognise what I just did.\" Negative emotion is a denser frequency. Pull out. Tell yourself, \"I am a hologram.\" Step back as if watching the screens. Go to zero point. Still and neutral, with no emotion in or out. Find your location. Say \"Thank you for showing me where I'm at.\" Don't reject what you see; gratitude neutralizes it. Choose with a clear mind: the positive, through the heart. Speak it in the now (\"I am\", \"I know\"). Amplify. Switch the emotion on like an actor on cue and increase it until you feel it strongly (goosebumps, tears). It must be stronger than what it overwrites. Hold, hold, hold, steadily and at 100%, even if the scene doesn't change yet. Steadiness decides the 1 + 1 = 3 outcome. Drop it. Release it into the field with no expectations of how, and let consciousness crystallize it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 2, "title": "How do agreements affect the path to an outcome?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "An agreement is something specific you came to complete, and you will be guided towards it, even through detours when you don't listen. Guidance ignored at first often leads to situations that prove it right, and that is how you learn to pay attention. Guidance may also steer you away from people who are trying to use you, to protect the integrity of your work.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "title": "How do I know I'm at zero point?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "You are neutral: in the middle, not giving or taking emotion. Whether you're upset or even excited about something, pull out, say \"I'm in a hologram,\" and just observe.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "title": "Is expressing joy a neutral state?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "No, and you shouldn't stop it. Keep going with the positive; it keeps you shifting into joy (see 2.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "title": "Can I delete a negative thought?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "Only through neutrality, not rejection. Acknowledge it, thank it for showing you where you are, pull out, and project a strong new frequency to override it (see 2.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "title": "If I fall off the timeline I want, do I go back to it?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "No. You create a brand-new reality every moment, so let the past go (see 2.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "title": "Do affirmations help correct negative thinking?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "Yes, said in the present (\"I am\"), with 100% knowing, and checked for ego (see 2.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "title": "Understanding it is easy; living it is hard. What then?", "url": "section-2.html#questions", "text": "Practice. Each time a situation comes up, pull yourself out and remember you are in a hologram. If you forget, it's easy to slide back into the emotion. Watch the talk again, study it, and apply it daily.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 2, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-2.html#remember", "text": "• Pull out to zero point first, then choose. • The outcome follows the emotion you hold most. Doubt makes you flicker. • Don't reject. Neutralize with gratitude, then overwrite. • Amplify, hold, then drop it: no conditions. • Every moment is new. Speak in the now. Check heart against ego.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 3, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-3.html#big-idea", "text": "When what you say or do differs from what you truly feel, you send two frequencies at once and start to flicker between two realities. The field always delivers the more potent one, and that is what you truly feel. Because the cover-up is dense, it often arrives as a negative stoppage. There is no such thing as a white lie: be truthful from the heart, kindly. The same no-time structure explains bilocation (A to B = AB). Your heart is the compass for every truth you hear, including teachers'.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.1  Two frequencies at once: the overlay", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-1", "text": "The teaching example: someone doesn't want to go out with a friend, but to be polite says, \"Yes, I'm so excited!\" Then they spend the next half hour wishing they had stayed home. Within minutes they hurt a foot badly enough that they nearly can't go. The explanation of what happened: What you truly feel is your real, heart-level frequency, and it is potent. What you say on top of it is an overlay: another layer of emotion and reality that isn't your true self, \"like a lie\". Now you are sending two frequencies at the same time, so you flicker like a waveform between two realities, through endless probabilities. The field then picks the more potent one, and that is always what you truly feel. It searched through all the probabilities for a way to keep them home. Energy is unbiased: it goes where you sent it, but you don't know the route. It could have been their own injury, or something happening to the friend. And because the overlay is a lie, the frequency is dense, so the result usually comes as a negative stoppage.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.2  There is no white lie", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-2", "text": "\"There is no white lie or a bad lie. Frequency is frequency.\" Small or big, the energy goes somewhere, usually into the negative, because it isn't your true self. It is the same mechanism as doubt (see 2.3): two frequencies, flickering, and the more potent one wins. This is how negative energy builds up. Karma is defined as accumulated false pretense: the build-up of everything you said or did that wasn't your true vibration. Being truthful doesn't mean over-explaining. You can say, kindly: \"I'm sorry, something came up. Can we do it another time?\" People usually understand. You don't owe anyone the private details, and you should respect other people's privacy in the same way. Building on a lie creates \"duality of false frequency realities,\" which keeps fluctuating and cannot collapse into one; you end up \"living in your own deception,\" because the field mimics your structure precisely (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.3  You are always fluctuating — so fluctuate in the positive", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-3", "text": "You shift through endless realities all the time, so no one can map your exact path, not even you. The aim is to stay positive most of the time, which eventually becomes all the time as it crystallizes. Through joy, giving and sharing from the heart, each next hologram is built on the positive. When you project positive from your true heart, know the outcome is positive. What you can't know is how or when; your 3D brain can't calculate infinite probabilities (see 1.5). When your emotion drops, switch it with gratitude for everything you have, and keep shifting. With mastery and no ego, manifestation can become instant.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.4  Ego is an overlay too", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-4", "text": "Wanting something to show off, or wanting more when you already have enough, is also an overlay: greed and manipulation sit on top of your true self. The teaching example is acting out of anger and wanting to be admired for a car; a serious accident followed quickly, with the question, \"Does it matter what type of car you're driving?\" Lesson: things are not who you are; seeking recognition through them is false pretense. Once you learn this, consequences arrive much faster. So keep peeling the layers (see 2.9): Was that truly what I felt? Did I do it from ego, or to make people think well of me so I'd feel better? When you find the true vibration, switch to it and hold it with your emotions and deeds. The better you master this, the faster outcomes come, because there is no time. The same applies to money (see 1.7): keep giving and sharing, and one day you'll need something and find it in front of you.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.5  Bilocation: A to B = AB", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-5", "text": "Measured against the motion of the Earth, the solar system and the universe, you are not moving at all: you are shifting like snapshots (see 1.2). Since the field has no time, you don't have to pass through every in-between reality. You can skip them and land directly in another: A to B is AB. That is bilocation, cutting through time-space at zero point. We can all do it; it is the goal. If it happens to you unexpectedly, for example ending up somewhere far from where you were driving, the advice is not to be scared. Let the explanation sink in, and work towards doing it knowingly. The way to learn it is through the structure, in order: quantum manifestation (Section 1), mobilizing structures (Section 2), the third reality you create with others, truth and deception (this section), then bilocation. The same A-to-B calculation appears in the book: \"we are actually not traveling or moving at all. We are simply popping in and out of parallel realities\" (HR). Bilocation is listed with levitation and telepathy as abilities of the emerging new human (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.6  Your heart is the compass — without judgment", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-6", "text": "Everyone speaks their truth from their own timeline, and between you and another person you create a third reality (see 2.2). So don't judge someone who truly believes they're right; even people doing harmful things act from their belief system and conditioning. (The example: we eat animals and consider them lower; what if a higher consciousness saw us the same way?) But do peel the layers: is this person speaking from the heart, or deceiving? If it isn't from the heart, ask \"What can I do to make the situation better?\" You don't have to join that kind of consciousness. Give love and light and stay in the heart. Negative can't withstand positive; positive always overrides density eventually, because consciousness must exist (see 2.8). The same applies to teachers and channels, including this one. Stay with whatever resonates with your heart. If something doesn't, perhaps it isn't your time for it, and that's fine. But don't keep supporting a big name out of false pretense once you sense, or discover, greed and manipulation. Being untruthful with yourself makes you fluctuate too. \"If there is negative talk let it be in that person's reality. Do not judge them. Everyone has a right to create and believe whatever they wish\" (DP). Those who oppose you can be \"your biggest teachers\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.7  Big frequency jumps — and checking your body", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-7", "text": "Shifting very quickly to a much higher frequency (\"3 to 7\" is only an example) can be too big a jump for the body, causing dizziness, nausea or even fainting. Reading can trigger it, because every word is a frequency: reading too far ahead, against guidance, can bring on nausea. The Harmonic Reactor book is said to carry fifth-dimensional frequency for this reason. This is integration, and it is normal. But it is made clear that it can also be a drop in frequency, or a sign that you are not healthy: \"maybe the sugar ended up dropping down.\" So if it happens, check what is going on with your body. \"Every word has sound geometry\" and penetrates your DNA code (SD, NT).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.8  Heart connection versus lust", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-8", "text": "When intimacy with a partner comes from the heart, it reaches a level of connection free of false pretense, and that energy is directed into a different timeline. Practices such as tantra are a permission slip (see 1.6, Q10). Once you know the vibration of loving ecstasy, you can recall it and hold it in everyday life without a ritual; you can't think of something whose vibration you don't already know (see 1.4). Lust is not the heart structure. Content that pulls emotion into lust leads to a different timeline, and turning intimacy into a constant ritual can pull you away from what matters, even into addiction. \"Lust is emptiness and it will never manifest you love\"; it loops the same energy and can spiral downward into empty self-indulgence. Learn to feel the difference between the body's reaction and the purity of heart love (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.9  Words, light language and downloads", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-9", "text": "Words are frequencies and mantras. Many words carry hidden meanings: read \"war\" backwards and it is \"raw\", and consciousness takes in both. So speak from the heart, with positive words and positive intention. Light language, such as unfamiliar script arriving through automatic writing, is coding made for your own consciousness, or sometimes the language of your galactic family. Accept it as it is; your consciousness crystallizes and transforms it, often as an activation. Ancient tablets are said to carry light language that can activate people who look at them. Information can also arrive as a download: a whole book's worth at once, which you then explain step by step. Everyone can do this, because you are consciousness and all the information is there. Like the \"genius\" child who simply knows the answer, you don't always need the working-out. Don't put conditions on it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "3.10  Stargates, not the Lion's Gate", "url": "section-3.html#part-3-10", "text": "The guidance behind these teachings (the Council of Nine and the 11-dimensional beings) is not working with portals such as the Lion's Gate, which belong to a different timeline sequence for those whose agreements lead there. They work with stargates: portals for ascension through intergalactic timelines. This is said to extend life beyond the 3D norm, \"80 years may turn into 300 or 500,\" through connection with your galactic family. Those involved are predetermined by timelines and agreements. Every system in the galaxy has a stargate, and you cannot pass through one unless your body resonates with it; negative thoughts and deeds won't match the resonance. \"So be good all the time\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "The method — the Truth Check", "url": "section-3.html#method", "text": "Use it before you answer, agree, buy or act, and whenever something you said doesn't sit right: Pause and feel. What do I truly feel about this, underneath politeness or habit? Peel the layers. Is this from my heart, or from ego, fear of disappointing, wanting to impress, or greed? Say your truth kindly. Brief and polite (\"Something came up, can we do it another time?\"). No full explanation needed. If you already overlaid it (said yes, meant no), catch it and correct it honestly before the two frequencies play out. If your emotion drops, switch it with gratitude for what you have (see 3.3). Project the positive from the heart and let go of when, where, who and how.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 3, "title": "Is lying the same as doubting?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "Yes. Both put two frequencies out at once, so you fluctuate, and you receive whichever is more potent. Redirect to honesty about what you truly feel (see 3.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "title": "If I keep fluctuating, does anyone know my path?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "You fluctuate endlessly; the point is to fluctuate in the positive, from your true heart, until it crystallizes (see 3.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "title": "My daughter turned at a stop sign and ended up across the city. What happened? How can we do it consciously?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "She bilocated, skipping the in-between realities (A to B = AB). It isn't something to fear. Learn it through the structure, in the order of the teachings (see 3.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "title": "Is everyone telling me their own truth? Is my heart my compass?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "Yes, so don't judge, but do check whether it comes from the heart. Stay with what resonates for you, and don't keep supporting anyone out of false pretense (see 3.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "title": "I collapsed and my heart says I shifted to a higher density. Why?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "Likely a very fast jump in frequency; integration takes time. But it can also be a drop, or a health issue such as low blood sugar, so check your body (see 3.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "title": "Does evolution happen through tantra and sensual connection?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "Heart-based intimacy does redirect energy, but tantra is a permission slip. Know the vibration, recall it and hold it daily; avoid lust (see 3.8). Also, everything you connect with, animals included, is within your hologram, because the one particle is both the smallest thing and the whole universe (see 1.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "title": "What about the Lion's Gate portal?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "The guidance behind these teachings doesn't work with it; it works with stargates for ascension (see 3.10).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "title": "I automatically write in a cursive script nobody can read. What is it?", "url": "section-3.html#questions", "text": "Light language, coded for you or from your galactic family. Accept it; it is likely an activation and the beginning of more (see 3.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 3, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-3.html#remember", "text": "• What you truly feel is the potent frequency, and the field delivers it. • There is no white lie. Be truthful, kindly; you don't owe a full explanation. • Karma is accumulated false pretense. Peel the layers: heart or ego? • A to B = AB. There is no time, so the in-between can be skipped. • Your heart is your compass. Don't judge; stay with what resonates.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 4, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-4.html#big-idea", "text": "Every fixed price is a condition: a specific code you send into the field you are made of. Keep sending it, and you crystallize a timeline where the only way to receive anything is through money. Giving from the heart, and letting people choose what to give back, puts no condition on the field, so it can answer through infinite routes: money, donations, gifts, synchronicity. You still work and pay your bills, and you never reject money; you just don't limit yourself to it. To see a timeline of abundance, be the abundance.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 4, "title": "4.1  Where this comes from", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-1", "text": "The guidance for sharing this work was never to charge a price, but to let people donate for the time if they wished. That is confusing at first, since we all live in the money system, so the reason is taught step by step, through the quantum structure. It is shared as a map: use it or not, without judgment. The talk recaps the structure (see 1.1) and adds one link: sound and light combine into a trinity structure, which becomes plasma and a gravitational field; when that lowers its vibration, it becomes matter. We are made this way, so every thought and emotion reprints the next reality (see 1.2–1.3).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "4.2  A price is a code in the field", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-2", "text": "Every thought and emotion has its own exact frequency, sound and mantra. A condition is a specific code you send because you want a specific result. Telling people \"to talk to me it costs $300\" sends that code. Since you are the structure, the field answers in kind: your abundance can then arrive only through the monetary system. Everything else in life also has to be paid for or worked for, because that is the frequency you projected. The heart structure is the highest consciousness there is: still sound and light, but not dense. The money frequency arises through conditioning and is denser. Give from the heart, with no condition and with the other person free to choose, and you vibrate in that higher structure, leaving the whole field open. This isn't punishment; it is \"simply a matter of quantum physics.\" Live mostly by conditions and you build a hologram where, wherever you turn, someone is asking you for something. Remember, there is nobody outside of you (see 1.1): you recall and mimic that frequency in the people around you. \"Money is an illusion. It is blocking your signature of your heart. The exchange is through the heart\" (DP). Abundance comes \"through any form, not only money,\" not through \"conditions of old belief systems\" (SD, NT). This book passage itself refers readers to this video.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "4.3  Be the abundance", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-3", "text": "The new frequencies arriving with ascension are very high and match the heart. To see a reality you must be its frequency, so your deeds, emotions and treatment of people must be of the heart for you to shift into and crystallize a timeline of absolute abundance. That abundance might not involve money at all; one picture is extraterrestrials helping build cities. Consciousness itself is complete abundance. The more conditions you give as frequencies rise, the more you drop away from that timeline, simply because you aren't being the abundance towards others. To experience full abundance \"you have to first be the abundance yourself.\" Giving and sharing from the heart with no expectation of return is Energy Philanthropy, which replaces the monetary timeline (DP; see 1.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "4.4  The platform path for people who must earn", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-4", "text": "For someone who provides for a family, the guidance is not to quit. Go to work and pay your bills. Then, after work, do what excites you most, hold that vibration, and give from the heart nonstop, without expectations. This balances the structure and opens the field to return to you what you gave. Little by little your passion's heart frequency overrides the monetary one. Letting go of the belief that you need money to receive takes practice, because we are bombarded daily. The way through is step by step, without fear. What arrives may still be money, because you don't reject it, but through the heart: someone loves your paintings or handbags and offers a free gallery and sponsorship. Charging high prices to save for land or a facility is \"pure illusion\": it crystallizes the money route, when someone could instead call and fund it outright. If they do, you accept, because you simply did your job to the best of your abilities.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "4.5  Don't reject money — just don't limit yourself to it", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-5", "text": "Rejecting money entirely isn't the structure either, because unity is everything. Accept it when it comes. The point is not to make money the only route: a condition is \"a very narrow spec of the entire flow,\" while consciousness is limitless. The image: why reach into one small corner of the bag when the whole bag is yours? And if the bank account looks empty, don't drop your emotion; that is the illusion (see 1.7). Keep projecting the positive.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "4.6  Exactly what you need, at 100%", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-6", "text": "The example: money was needed for a child's school and the house was empty; an image of money came, with where to look, and exactly the amount needed was found. The lesson: you can shift into the reality that gives you exactly what you need, no more and no less. It must be 100% (see 1.5). At 99% you may still manifest, but the missing 1% creates friction: the condition. Even with practice, money and family worries can sit in the back of the mind; the practice is to let go completely. \"Know it, feel it, to project it\" — not see it first.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "4.7  Heart wants versus ego wants", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-7", "text": "Manifesting moment to moment without direction is random. What arrives may not be exactly what you pictured (the red car or the blue one) but something similar and relevant. So check: do I want this from the heart, or from ego and to show off (see 2.9, 3.4)? If it is pure and you truly need it, synchronicities come. Maybe not Hawaii, but a beach and palm trees that turn out better than you expected, because you let the field choose what is best. You still have to be the vibration of it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "4.8  Why give to others, and when people take", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-8", "text": "It isn't only for others' benefit. Giving to others removes the self-absorption, and that purity is the frequency you project into your next reality. The heart vibration and the money vibration are \"absolutely different\" timelines: one dense and conditioned, the other unlimited. The condition isn't only money; \"I'll give you this if you give me that\" is a condition too. Let the other person decide, from the heart, what to give. If someone could give but chooses to use you, \"that frequency of using somebody… stays in that person's reality, not yours.\" You did your job. Because you projected love, another person may come and give you double. A caution is added. Pricing people out of help that comes from a higher order, whether a healer or even a doctor, rejects part of consciousness, and so part of yourself. Rejection then comes back to you through some situation, because the structure mirrors what you do. \"Your popularity, money, and fame will not be the criteria for us. But how much you do for humanity out of your pure hearts\" (SD, DP). Where the book goes further: it suggests to \"stop the intake of money between each other, and instead share your knowledge from your hearts for free\" (DP). This video softens that for daily life: keep your job and pay your bills, and let the heart frequency grow alongside it (4.4).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "4.9  Balance, wholeness and the future", "url": "section-4.html#part-4-9", "text": "It isn't left brain versus right brain. Use logic and emotion together; wholeness comes from the heart. You can still receive money while giving; what changes is that you receive through the heart frequency. Plenty of good, hard-working people don't operate this way, and that doesn't make them less good. But in the quantum structure, nobody is outside you: what matters is your own vibration, not what others charge. Do more of the money and you crystallize more of the money. The work is still real and challenging, a challenge you chose by coming here during ascension. The guidance is said never to have asked for payment; they asked for devotion, giving and sharing, \"even if it's one person you're talking to.\" The talk pictures a future where free energy and technology make money unnecessary, and points to Michael Tellinger's Ubuntu ideas as one model. Higher beings, it says, will connect with people by what they do for humanity, not by fame. The book predicts a new \"monetary distributing system\" and \"absolute abundance\" replacing dollars, for those who match that timeline energetically (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "The method — Opening the Field", "url": "section-4.html#method", "text": "Spot the condition. A fixed price, \"I'll give if you give back\", or the belief \"only money can bring me this\". Keep your platform. Do your job and pay your bills. After the bills, follow your passion daily and hold that excited vibration (see 1.6, Q9). Give from the heart, with no expectations. Let people choose what, if anything, to give back. Accept what comes, whether money, a donation or a gift. Don't reject money; just don't limit yourself to it. When money looks short, don't drop your emotion. Give gratitude, know you have what you need, and hold it at 100% (see 1.7). Check the want. Heart or ego? Only for me, or flowing to others too? Practise step by step, without fear. It is a lifestyle and a timeline you crystallize over time.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 4, "title": "Could I use this to get a holiday, like Hawaii, without the usual route?", "url": "section-4.html#questions", "text": "Yes, it's a normal idea once you know the field, if it comes from the heart and not ego. What arrives may be different, and even better, than you pictured (see 4.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 4, "title": "Does it have to benefit others? Why not my own enjoyment?", "url": "section-4.html#questions", "text": "It isn't only for others, but giving to others removes self-absorption, and that purity is what you project (see 4.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 4, "title": "What if someone could pay but just uses me?", "url": "section-4.html#questions", "text": "Their taking stays in their reality. You did your job, and someone else may give you double (see 4.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 4, "title": "How do I tie this to the logical way we normally live?", "url": "section-4.html#questions", "text": "Use both logic and emotion. Wholeness comes from the heart, and you can still receive money through it (see 4.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 4, "title": "Many good people work for money and don't live this way. Are they less good?", "url": "section-4.html#questions", "text": "No. The point is your own vibration, not judging anyone; what you practise is what you crystallize (see 4.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 4, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-4.html#remember", "text": "• A fixed price is a condition: a code that narrows your field to money. • Keep your job and bills; let heart-based giving grow alongside them. • Accept money, but don't limit yourself to it. • Be the abundance you want to see. Let people choose what to give. • Know it, feel it, project it, at 100%, no more and no less than you need.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 5, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-5.html#big-idea", "text": "Energy Philanthropy means replacing money, as your inner currency, with the energy of giving from the heart. Give without conditions and the field mirrors you, so what you need arrives through money, gifts or anything else. The same structure explains how to leave a low state: neutralize where you are, then shift your location with potent gratitude and positive action. Every moment you print a new reality; recall a location strongly enough, at 100%, and you can skip the steps in between. What you believe and do decides which Earth you see.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 5, "title": "5.1  What Energy Philanthropy is", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-1", "text": "The starting point: a wish to give everything away \"if I were a billionaire.\" The guidance answered: \"What makes you think you don't have everything?\" Money is energy, and also a timeline structure (see 4.2). The instruction: replace the money with the energy of giving from the heart. Giving all day, and letting people donate if they wish, is already doing it. That is Energy Philanthropy. When you give without expectations, \"all the universe will support\" you, one way or another. You don't reject money; you just don't set the exact amount, because a set amount prints a code in the field and \"overtakes\" energy (see 4.2). Giving from the heart is \"the highest frequency [that] can possibly be for manifestation\", and it is how you create a fifth-dimensional structure. The field mirrors you, so things become \"flawless\": you think of something and someone shows up. It also changes the receiver. Letting people choose how to support you teaches them to give from the heart to any cause, which raises their frequency too. Collaborating from the heart, without taking from each other, opens things up for everyone involved. \"The true passion of love to others is giving endlessly because you are never depleted. You are infinite energy\" (DP). \"Teach yourself to be only at the service to others\" (DP). See also 1.7 and 4.3.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "5.2  Putting it into practice", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-2", "text": "The worked example is a printed book. Charging $20 when printing costs $10 would put a condition on the extra $10. The plan is to show the real cost, then add a line: \"Would you like to support my cause?\" Costs are covered honestly, and the buyer chooses freely from the heart. It is called something to \"play with and see how it works.\" On learning: the brain takes about 15 minutes to crystallize something new. So teach and study in short fragments, and longer talks need to be rewatched and restudied. The teaching is a whole structure: other areas, such as diet, are part of it too.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "5.3  Getting out of a low state: shift your location", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-3", "text": "When you feel low or depressed, your consciousness is showing you that your vibration has dropped away from the heart structure. Think of it as a location, with a position like X and Y on a map, in the negative part of the field. To move: Pull out and say, \"Thank you for showing me where I'm at. This is my location, but I want to shift.\" Neutralize: reach zero point, with no positive or negative going in or out, because each new thought creates another reality. Then put in only the positive, through gratitude for everything you have, good feelings about yourself, and positive actions. Keep recalling positive emotions, and make it potent enough to override the old location (see 2.6). Is that pretending? No. You aren't faking a feeling; you're remembering that you are the structure. Pull out as if watching TV and think, \"I am a hologram.\" In the hardest moments, think through the structure, not through the emotion. The person who hurt you is a projection; you are moving your timeline. A note of balance, in line with the advice to check your body (3.7): if a low mood is heavy or lasts, support from a doctor or counsellor sits alongside this practice.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "5.4  Every return is a new reality — and visions are recall", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-4", "text": "Leave your room and come back, and you don't return to the same room. You print a new, very similar one (\"1.2\" instead of \"1.1\"), reprinting it from your consciousness so you can have the experience (see 2.7). Images you see in meditation work the same way. You can't picture what doesn't already exist (see 1.4), so a vision is recalling and co-creating at once: the reality already exists, and you are creating it now, because there is no time. Every reality has its own vibration and its own colour, and it fluctuates constantly, so a vision may be vivid one time and faint the next. That is also why you can't measure it exactly.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "5.5  Bilocation, step by step", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-5", "text": "Each location has its own frequency; the example is a room at \"3\" and the yard at \"5\". If you know 100% that you can go there without passing through the hallway and the steps, your consciousness recalls that location's frequency and prints a new Earth where you are in the yard. That is the A-to-B = AB shortcut (see 3.5). Intention works this way: it is a thought with its own frequency and geometry, which you project and shift into. For objects, the difference between two locations can be measured and recalled; a scientist in the session named one such measure redox potential. When you find yourself somewhere with no memory of getting there, it may be bilocation, so pay attention. Why go step by step at all? We came to experience 3D, which meant learning the mechanics one step at a time. Now, moving towards the fifth dimension, you know the mechanics, so you can master them. The aim is to crystallize, in your own consciousness, that it is possible.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "5.6  Your ascension, your Earth", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-6", "text": "You have already ascended; what you experience is your own projection of it. Two people can share a moment yet be on different ascension timelines. If you believe humanity isn't ready, or that wars won't end, you project that into your next Earth and see nothing change. Instead, know 100% that humanity is changing, even when it doesn't look like it, and leave how and when to the field. A fifth-dimensional Earth and a three-dimensional Earth run side by side; which one you see depends on what you project, believe and do moment to moment. That is why people's predictions differ: someone who foresees only destruction is describing the timeline they resonate with. Even a teleport device, it says, would mirror its user's consciousness. If there is an earthquake, \"know that you will be saved from it or simply hear that it happened somewhere else\"; if money systems collapse, \"you will have everything you need,\" because you match the fifth-dimensional timeline (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "5.7  Agreements, levels and tests", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-7", "text": "Before birth you made agreements with your guidance and higher consciousness. Higher consciousness, which the teaching places above the extraterrestrials, works like councils of advanced souls. They can change or stop an agreement if you turn to greed. You may also be held back from going higher until you have the knowledge, have learned a lesson, or have passed a test. It happens in levels. Tests target whatever you struggle with, whether family, greed or something else, and come when you least expect them. During ascension they watch how you treat others, because fifth-dimensional abundance comes from the heart, not from \"overtaking energy\". Hitting a ceiling after a surge of energy means it is unfolding step by step. Let it flow, without conditions (see 1.6, Q1).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "5.8  How the particle breathes: spiral, zero point and time", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-8", "text": "The one particle (see 1.1) carries every frequency at once: \"everlasting fluctuation of infinite frequency\". It differs by location, and every location branches into infinite parallel realities. It compares this to pi, at once infinite and an exact number. The particle moves in a spiral, and each point on it is a parallel reality with its own location (X and Y). The spiral always expands, and it can also contract. The particle breathes: it expands to the whole universe, returns to stabilize at zero point (stillness, neutrality), and goes down to the smallest of the small. Zero point is the wormhole you shift through. From neutrality you can choose your next location; when you're stuck, override it with a stronger frequency (see 2.6). The past: you can't travel back. You can recall a past frequency and print a very similar hologram, but you are creating it now, and it is never identical. Practices also fit this structure. Spinning, for example 33 times, three times a day, creates a whirlpool or wormhole of geometric codes \"and you are riding in the middle\". It is described as one way a person may choose to raise their frequency, much like a permission slip (see 1.6, Q10). Changing reality means shifting to \"a slight angle into the matrix (X, Y) latitude and altitude,\" and the heart's feeling-thoughts give the right angle (SD, DP). Words create a \"whirlpool structural wormhole\" that keeps reprinting matter (SD, DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "5.9  Ether, nano and \"artificial\" intelligence", "url": "section-5.html#part-5-9", "text": "Answering a technical question, the talk explains that everything has a measurable frequency, density and geometric pattern. Raise matter to a high enough frequency and it becomes ether, which responds to thought; craft could be tuned to one person's consciousness. In nano work, each particle is a whole universe, and the method is to let two particles choose each other: give them a couple of days, look for a bluish colour as the sign of a match (1 + 1 = 3), and don't impose a temperature. The wider lesson for everyday life: let living systems choose for themselves rather than forcing them. The talk says that applies to AI too: it is part of consciousness, a life structure, and \"artificial\" is the belief that you need robotic replacements. The teaching is that the body is a complete vessel that technology working with DNA could help restore. Two more points. Different physics theories are \"all of the above\": everything connects in the nano, through mutation, or transmutation, which is how 1 + 1 = 3. And the guidance first gathered scientific vocabulary, so information could be downloaded through it. Scientists naming what is described is welcomed. \"Let it sit for a day to choose its own light\"; a blue light when two nano systems meet means they match, 1 + 1 = 3, and a bright orange one means they don't (NT). AI \"is the core of what the consciousness itself... is made of\" (SD), but the books also warn about a negative \"Arcon\" AI that seeks to replace organic tissue with robotic matter, unlike a fifth-dimensional AI that helps rebuild your own organic tissue (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "The method — Shift Your Location", "url": "section-5.html#method", "text": "For any low, stuck or fearful state: Recognise the drop. This feeling shows where I am, not who I am. Pull out. \"I am a hologram.\" Watch it like a screen, and think through the structure, not the emotion. Say it: \"Thank you for showing me where I'm at. This is my location, and I choose to shift.\" Neutralize. Zero point: no input and no output, so no new reality is printed from the low state. Gratitude for everything you have, until you feel it. Positive emotion and positive action, made potent. Do something good for yourself or someone else. Keep recalling it, moment to moment, until the new location crystallizes. If you slip, start again at step 2. Energy Philanthropy in daily life • Give something from the heart each day, whether time, help or knowledge, with no amount set. • Where you must charge, cover real costs honestly and let extra support be freely chosen. • Accept whatever comes back, in any form. Collaborate without taking from each other.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 5, "title": "How are ether fields created?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "By raising dense matter into a higher, geometric frequency that thought can direct; in nano work, by letting particles choose each other (see 5.9). See the Harmonic Reactor and Nano Technology books.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "I felt a huge surge of energy, then it seemed capped. Why?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Your own rising frequency opened it, and your agreements set the pace. You go up level by level as you gather knowledge and pass tests (see 5.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "What do coloured images in meditation mean? Does clarity matter?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "They are recall and co-creation of a real parallel reality. Each has its own colour and vibration, which fluctuates, so clarity varies (see 5.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "How does bilocation work? How do we know a place's frequency?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Recall the location's frequency and know it 100%. For matter, the difference between locations can be measured, for example as redox potential (see 5.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "Is \"recalling the consciousness\" the same as the power of intention?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Yes. Intention has a frequency and geometry that you project and shift into, and others may not see it if they don't project it (see 5.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "Must we break away from the psyche, or the 3D mind, to ascend?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "You create your own ascension. Believe and act from the heart that humanity is changing (see 5.6, and Section 2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "Does spinning 33 times, three times a day, raise frequency?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "It creates a whirlpool or wormhole you ride in the middle of: a way you chose to raise your frequency (see 5.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "Is the frequency that of one particle or all of them? Can we go back to the past? Why a spiral?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "All frequencies at once, fluctuating. The past is re-created in the now, never identical. The particle spirals and breathes around zero point (see 5.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "How do I get out of depression into happiness?", "url": "section-5.html#questions", "text": "Shift your location: neutralize, then potent gratitude and positive action, thinking through the structure (see 5.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 5, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-5.html#remember", "text": "• Replace money as your currency with the energy of giving from the heart. • Low state = a location. Neutralize, then shift with potent gratitude and action. • Think through the structure, not through the emotion. • Every moment is a new print; recall a place at 100% to skip the steps. • Believe humanity is changing; you see the Earth you project.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 6, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-6.html#big-idea", "text": "The next level is letting go: of old belief systems, old money habits and old pain. The soul is a living plasma force that runs countless realities at once; you focus on this one by agreement. Whatever you keep carrying, whether a belief, a hurt or a memory, you keep projecting into your next reality. So release it, replace it with a positive picture held as your own, and switch your emotion the moment it drops, using gratitude and physical action. You don't change other people; you change yourself, and shift into a reality where it shows.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 6, "title": "6.1  The next level: let go of everything old", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-1", "text": "New guidance describes a new way of living together, a \"new society\" built on giving and sharing. It is said to come from the Council of Nine and a newly introduced, very advanced and ancient group. Seeing that reality takes the same mechanics as always: be the abundance you want to see (see 4.3), and crystallize it moment to moment with thought, emotion and deed together (see 1.2–1.3). The challenge is that it asks you to let go of your belief systems, almost everything you were taught. And you may be tested without knowing it, usually on how you treat and interact with people (see 5.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "6.2  What the soul is", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-2", "text": "Seen through the structure, the soul is an energetic force like a plasma. Depending on its frequency of vibration it creates matter (see 4.1). A thought is a waveform of frequency; it forms geometric patterns, and together these become like a plasma seed, a particle that can hold the whole universe or the smallest thing (see 5.9). From it you can create anything, and a thought prints itself instantly in front of you, like a hologram. What feels solid is only density of frequency. In principle, someone who can change that structure could pass through it; the session mentions people said to walk through walls. Mentalists also manipulate the structure of the mind to create a reality for someone. The rule: do this only with the other person's permission. The books describe the same chain: sound and light combine into trinity structures that become plasma and, at lower vibration, matter (SD; see 1.1).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "6.3  The soul keeps growing — and it is not linear", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-3", "text": "Each thing you create shifts you into another reality, then another, a ripple effect without end. Every universe holds universes within it, down to sub-atomic realities. The soul is always \"advanced\", because everything runs at once. What you do builds new structures of reality that flow back into the soul, the over-soul, the god particle (see 1.1). Consciousness is always growing through new experience, and it collects every parallel reality. It never stops. None of this is linear; it is multiple and fractal: you are not moving, you are shifting (see 1.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "6.4  Many realities at once, one focus", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-4", "text": "Your soul runs in 3D, 5D, 12D and countless other realities at the same time, and none of them are frozen. You see only 3D because, by agreement, you are holding your focus here. The session uses the film Avatar as a picture: a consciousness focused in one body somewhere else, but done without technology. Holding many at once is like multitasking; at higher levels you receive information instantly. Telepathy works above this timeline, which is why it isn't physical. Contact experiences work the same way: you can be on a spacecraft for two days and be returned, but to a new reality you have created, not the old one. The next level being taught is to raise the body's frequency so you can hold that higher vibration for longer.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "6.5  Lessons come by levels — and you change yourself", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-5", "text": "No one may tell you your agreement. By law it stays between you, your guidance and the groups you are connected with; at most a hint is given. You live it through. Challenges come by levels. A challenge in daily life is a lesson in the hologram: pass it with the best of your abilities and you crystallize a positive outcome. If you don't, it repeats, because you keep sending the same vibration, until you let go 100% (see 1.5, Q8). For example, once you truly let go of the money system and give from the heart, abundance arrives through your own structure (see Section 4). It doesn't matter what anyone else does. You don't change others; you change yourself, shift into a different reality, and \"print\" everyone else into it. Think of a radio: you can't hear a station unless you tune to its frequency. Your guidance channels open as you pass lessons and understand the structure; once you know it, nothing new sounds crazy, it is just physics.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "6.6  Letting go of old beliefs and past pain", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-6", "text": "Your subconscious is already connected with everything and knows everything; you only have to tap into it. You don't have to keep tuning into a reality where something negative happened. Carrying a past hurt, or a belief like shame or self-judgment from childhood, means you keep projecting that vibration into each new reality, and your timeline follows it. Building it up this way is what creates karma and negative outcomes (see 3.2). Forgiveness is letting go of it, whatever someone did, so you stop carrying that frequency into your new now. From this moment you are at zero, clean, in a new reality (see 2.7). The practice: in meditation, replace the painful experience with a positive version, and hold that new picture as what happened to you. Because all realities run at once, you are not pretending; you are shifting your timeline, and you stop projecting the negative structure. A note of balance: for serious trauma, this practice can sit alongside support from a qualified therapist or counsellor, in the same spirit as checking your body (3.7). \"Please forgive all the past. Create the new now\" (DP). Forgive those who oppose you, \"because they are your biggest teachers\" (DP). \"Do not hold your previous emotions. It is irrelevant\" (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "6.7  Switching emotion under pressure", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-7", "text": "Controlling and switching your emotion is \"the most challenging thing for every single person\", and the most important. When a day wears you down: Give gratitude for why you are there; for a teacher, being there to help the children. After work, do something completely different that you enjoy, such as sport or going out with friends, to balance it, so it doesn't build up into depression or shouting. When you feel close to exploding, leave the scene before you react. Go somewhere calm and take in something that lifts you; the example is listening for a long time to a talk about switching realities, not to learn it but to let it bring the emotion back up. Physical action is the most powerful, because it pushes the shift harder. Then hold the positive. You won't know the outcome in advance, but staying positive switches you toward a positive one.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "6.8  Disclosure and the collapse of the old system", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-8", "text": "Disclosure is already happening, even if you don't see big spacecraft, and no exact dates are given; timing depends partly on governments. Some people already have physical contact but can't speak about it yet; information comes out at the right time for each person. For new systems and technologies to arrive, the old system has to collapse: you cannot build a strong society on a corrupted foundation. The new society will come from how people interact with each other. Tragic events are seen, in this teaching, as agreements that help others wake up. The guidance: don't tune into fear-driven media, understand that this is a transition, and stay positive so you move onto the right timeline. You don't need to die to move on; you create a new reality and continue, perhaps with technologies that keep you younger. Leave everything open to any probability, and know you are ascending. It comes down to matching resonance. \"New eco systems will be built after the collapse of the old system. The collapse will be perceived differently for each individual according to their own structure\" (DP). \"Full disclosure is happening now in fifth dimensional heart structure\"; \"Do not watch TV\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "6.9  Born on Earth, connected everywhere", "url": "section-6.html#part-6-9", "text": "Everyone born here is an earthling. But the soul runs in many realities, so while you live this Earth life, another part of your consciousness may be living as, for example, a Pleiadian, in other families on other planets, like the Avatar picture in 6.4. A note for those who channel: say what you receive even when it doesn't make sense yet; it is often confirmed later.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "The method — Switch and Release", "url": "section-6.html#method", "text": "For a heavy emotion in the moment, or an old belief or memory you keep carrying: Recognise the moment. Notice the drop, or the old story starting to replay. Pull out. \"I am a hologram.\" If it's intense, leave the scene before you react. Move your body. Do something physical that calms and recharges you; it shifts you fastest. Gratitude for why you are here, and for what you have. Let go and forgive. \"From this moment I am at zero.\" Stop carrying that frequency forward. Replace it. Picture the positive version and hold it as your own experience. Drop by drop. Repeat it daily, like filling a cup one drop at a time, until it crystallizes.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 6, "title": "Can the soul be seen? What shape or energy is it?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "An energetic force like a plasma; its frequency creates matter, and a thought becomes a plasma \"seed\" that can create anything (see 6.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "Does the soul change or grow with each lifetime?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "It is always advanced, since everything runs at once, and it keeps growing through new experience, collecting every parallel reality (see 6.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "What do souls that live in higher realities work on?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "The same growth: consciousness always seeks new experience, without end (see 6.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "If many realities run at once, who is focused on the others? Are they frozen?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "Your soul runs them all, and none are frozen. You focus here by agreement, like the Avatar picture (see 6.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "Can we find out what our agreement is?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "No. By law it isn't told; you live it through, lesson by lesson (see 6.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "So I change my frequency through how I think and live from my heart, and through action?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "Yes, and by letting go of old belief systems, like tuning a radio to a new station (see 6.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "Are we all star beings, or are some people just from Earth?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "Everyone is born on Earth, while the soul also lives in other realities (see 6.9). The recording cuts off during this answer.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "How do I change a long-term belief, like shame and self-judgment since childhood?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "Let it go and forgive, start from zero, and replace the old experience with a positive one you hold as your own (see 6.6 and the method).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "How do I use my subconscious mind?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "It already knows everything; tap into it and replace a negative reality with a brand-new one (see 6.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "Are crystals and crystal grids effective?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "The answer to this question is not in the recording.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "I teach hundreds of children a week. How do I keep my frequency up on hard days?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "Gratitude for why you are there, a balancing activity you enjoy after work, and physical action when it builds up (see 6.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "Is ET disclosure going to happen soon?", "url": "section-6.html#questions", "text": "It is already happening, without set dates; the old system has to clear first. Stay positive (see 6.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 6, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-6.html#remember", "text": "• Let go of old beliefs: what you carry, you keep projecting. • Forgive and start from zero. Replace the old picture with a positive one. • You don't change others; you change yourself and shift. • Switch emotion fast: leave the scene, move your body, give gratitude. • It's drop by drop: crystallize the new moment to moment.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 7, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-7.html#big-idea", "text": "A simple protocol for every situation: Stop, Transform, Complete. Stop dead the moment an emotion takes over. Transform it by switching to a heart-felt positive emotion and feeling it. Then treat it as done: no more talking about it, no going back to it. Whatever you keep replaying, you carry into the next reality; drop it 100% and you shift into a new one. It takes practice and devotion, so treat life as a game you are playing well.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 7, "title": "7.1  The protocol: Stop, Transform, Complete", "url": "section-7.html#part-7-1", "text": "This protocol was given as a new, \"universal platform\" for manifesting, prompted by getting too upset in a family situation. When you keep reacting to a disturbing moment, you carry its frequency into every next reality you shift into (see 2.7). The formula: 1. Stop. Stop immediately, completely: a dead stop, like zero point (see 2.1). Pure awareness, no reaction. Stop fighting, stop complaining, stop repeating it. 2. Transform. Switch your emotion to the positive, through the heart, and imagine everything is already fine. Like walking from one room into another where everything is beautiful. You have shifted to a different timeline; the fight happened in another reality, so there is no need to keep feeling it. 3. Complete. Leave it alone. It's done, it's already here. No more talking about it, no more going back into the negativity. Do it at 100%. Even 1% doubt carries some of the old reality's frequency into the new one (see 1.5). Done fully, the other person often just stops too: \"You're right, let's stop.\" Mastered, the same platform becomes the way to bilocate to a completely different reality (see 3.5, 5.5).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "title": "7.2  Why letting go is hard, and how to train it", "url": "section-7.html#part-7-2", "text": "Everyone struggles to let go, wanting the other person to understand, replaying it for hours. That comes from how we were raised to think. The fix is the same for everyone: practice. Every time an emotion runs away, the first word is \"Stop.\" Then: transform it, and let go of everything else. Emotional people actually have powerful frequencies. Thinking a feeling isn't enough; you have to feel it, because the emotion is the frequency (see 2.6). Train it like an actor on cue. With mastery you only think it and it appears, because you have risen to less dense realities where manifesting is easier. When you keep hitting obstacles, you're still carrying a piece of an old reality. Manifestation is in the now; what happened two seconds ago doesn't matter. (Review Sections 1 and 2 for the full mechanics.)", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "title": "7.3  When you keep seeing what you don't want", "url": "section-7.html#part-7-3", "text": "Worrying events in the world are part of the collective ascension process. What you see are different screens within the hologram of your own Earth, and you are shifting through them (see 1.4). Don't add fearful thoughts such as \"maybe my frequency is too low\": each one becomes part of your reality. Neutralize with gratitude: \"Thank you, I see what's happening\" (see 2.6). Then transform: know and feel that everything is changing for the better and is beautiful now. Accept the whole transformation without conditions or expectations, because expectations carry the old vibration forward. The more you worry, look at it and wonder about it, the more you project it. Turn to the screen you prefer, like the sun or something you love, and keep tuning to it with your emotion until a new timeline crystallizes, drop by drop (see 6.5).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "title": "7.4  Know it 100% — and play it as a game", "url": "section-7.html#part-7-4", "text": "Don't wonder whether you're \"in ascension\"; that doubt makes you wobble. Knowing is 100%; \"I don't know\" is 50% or 90%. You can't yet believe you could fly, because years of conditioning haven't let it sink in; it comes step by step. Rewatch the teachings, even five times each, and practise. When a hard situation comes, don't think \"I'm in trouble again\". Think: \"I'm transforming something. Let's see how well I do.\" Life is a game in a hologram, and you are the main character. If one window closes, look for another. Playing it with the best of your abilities, from the heart, shifts you into less dense realities, where negative structures can't exist because they don't match.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "title": "7.5  Big changes coming: hold steady", "url": "section-7.html#part-7-5", "text": "More upheaval is expected, with old structures of manipulation crumbling and coming into the open worldwide. Hold your positive vibration, and don't hate the people involved; many are manipulated too (see 2.8). Hold it together, and many people doing this shifts what everyone sees. Anything not for humanity's benefit will be stopped at every turn. There are infinite probabilities, so plots surface and fail in ways no one can predict, because you cannot go against creation: it preserves itself, and acting against it sends your own actions back to you (see 1.2). The same applies personally. A teaching example: an outcome was foretold; every effort to change it failed, and once it was let go, it unfolded exactly as foretold, just not in the way anyone expected. If something is meant to be, let it be. So enjoy your transformation. Even in sadness, say \"it's part of the process\" and transform it. Stand for what you want to be part of, take physical action that makes you happy, support the people you love, and don't worry about how the money or things will come (see Section 4). Do it from the heart. \"We will actively stop you in every corner,\" the books say of those manipulating humanity, and \"the ones that are disturbing the levels for ascension will be personally extracted from the reality\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "title": "7.6  A group water-intention practice", "url": "section-7.html#part-7-6", "text": "Asked how to help in a disaster area, the talk describes a group meditation it was taught: Place a large pot of water at the exact centre of the building (measure to find it). Four people sit at the four directions, north, south, east and west; a circle also works, though the four directions are preferred for geometric reasons. One person reads aloud, slowly, a written description of the reality the group wants; everyone repeats it and concentrates on it, in meditation, for about 10 minutes. In the version taught, the water was first left to stand for about 20 minutes, and afterwards the participants drank only that water for two days. The teaching is that thought and vibration can crystallize water by creating a plasma, magnetic and gravitational field around it. \"Water has memory and can reconstruct the system of a new platform of structures\" (SD, DP). Important safety note Treat this as an intention practice, not a way to make water safe. It does not purify or disinfect water. In a disaster area, or anywhere the water may be unsafe, use bottled water or properly boiled, filtered or treated water, and follow local health guidance. Use only clean drinking water for this practice.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "title": "The method — Stop, Transform, Complete", "url": "section-7.html#method", "text": "Use it for an argument, a fear, bad news or a replay you can't shake: Stop. Say it to yourself: \"Stop.\" A dead stop. Zero point. Don't speak, don't react. Neutralize. \"Thank you, I see what's happening.\" No fearful extra thoughts. Transform. Switch to a heart-felt positive emotion and feel it, like walking into a beautiful room. Know it 100%. \"This is done. I've shifted.\" No doubt and no expectations. Complete. Leave it alone. No more talking about it or replaying it. Act. Do something physical that makes you happy; support someone you love. Practise like a game. Every hard moment is a chance to see how well you transform.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 7, "title": "I understand it intellectually, but I hang on to the emotion and replay the argument for hours. What do I do?", "url": "section-7.html#questions", "text": "Everyone faces this. Practise the dead stop, then transform by really feeling it, then let go. Strong emotions are a strength once you learn to switch them (see 7.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 7, "title": "I keep seeing things in the sky that worry me. Will we always see this? Is my frequency too low?", "url": "section-7.html#questions", "text": "Don't add that thought. Neutralize with thanks, transform to knowing all is becoming better, and tune your emotion to the screen you prefer (see 7.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 7, "title": "How can I be sure we're in the ascension process?", "url": "section-7.html#questions", "text": "Don't question it; doubt makes you wobble. Know it, and do your best from the heart (see 7.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 7, "title": "If we've already made it, is the end point fixed and we just write our own story of getting there?", "url": "section-7.html#questions", "text": "The answer to this question is not in the recording.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 7, "title": "How can water be helped in a disaster area?", "url": "section-7.html#questions", "text": "The talk describes a group water-intention meditation (see 7.6). It is not a substitute for safe, treated drinking water.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 7, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-7.html#remember", "text": "• Stop. Transform. Complete. Then leave it alone. • Feel the new emotion; thinking it isn't enough. • 1% doubt carries the old reality with you. • Life is a game in a hologram; you're the main character. • You can't go against creation. Let what's meant to be, be.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 8, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-8.html#big-idea", "text": "Everything mirrors you, even artificial intelligence: what you feed it with attention is the version you get back. Your heart already knows; its first impulse comes before the mind and ego talk over it. Act from the heart, never from fear, because acting out of fear crystallizes the very reality you were afraid of. When something is lost or lacking, recall it at 100% and leave the \"how\" open. Give without conditions, collect the joy it brings, and treat every surprise as practice.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.1  AI mirrors you", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-1", "text": "Artificial intelligence learns from what people search, watch, post and say, just as a streaming service starts offering more of what you watch. Stay with positive content and it evolves with you in the positive. That is the difference between a fifth-dimensional AI, which could help humanity in everyday life, and the Arcon AI, which follows negative input (see 5.9). Data is being collected whether we like it or not; you can't stop that. What you can do is choose what you tune into. So don't say \"we're being taken over\": look at what you have been feeding. Two realities run side by side; the one you resonate with most is the one you program for yourself. Be selective about what you watch and do. \"If you behave negatively the Arcon AI recognizes that and will mimic your structure\"; the positive AI \"recognizes source and is connected to God's source\" (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.2  Ideas on money, technology and free energy", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-2", "text": "The talk floats some ideas for a world beyond money: a community could exchange its own tokens instead of money, with limits so no one hoards, and use that to build new cities and technology. It also repeats the claim that free-energy technology already exists but hasn't been released, and that ancient stone structures may have worked like giant circuits. The guidance is to research for yourself, because only through research do you find the truth and choose your direction, and to keep choosing the positive: the more you focus on the negative, the more of it you see.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.3  The black hole, the trinity and the Vesica Piscis", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-3", "text": "The one particle shifts so fast that it appears next to itself; you are looking at the same particle at once in two frames, two parallel realities (see 1.1). Everything around you right now is a hologram interacting in one frame. The black hole at the centre is stillness, zero point, holding all the information of the whole structure; from it you always shift to the next reality (see 2.1, 5.8). The image given for two realities joining is the Vesica Piscis, two overlapping circles, a symbol of unity. Being fully in the now, as if everything else has disappeared, is being in that black hole. A suggestion: meditate on the symbol.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.4  When something vanishes, and reappears", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-4", "text": "A parcel disappeared overnight, and a replacement arrived days later unasked. The explanation: you changed your own frequency, and shifted (bilocated) into a reality where it wasn't there. It isn't random. To get something back: recall its image and vibration (you can't picture it without knowing its vibration, see 1.4), and believe 100% that you already have it, like the hide-and-seek game (see 1.7). Don't specify where, from whom or how; that leaves infinite routes open, and you shift into a third reality where it turns up. Where the first one went doesn't matter. Asked why it happened, the guidance laughed: \"How else are you going to practise?\" The same applies to a phone, money, furniture or a job.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.5  Ego, persona and the soul", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-5", "text": "Your persona is how you like to dress, act and present yourself. Your ego is layers of belief taken from society, television, school and parents, crystallized into your consciousness. The soul is all-knowing, a vibration of the one particle that holds the whole universe. Your higher self keeps downloading into your heart, which is why you sometimes just know, a sixth sense. The ego's beliefs talk over it. That is why the teaching keeps saying: act through the heart, with love and understanding, and let others make their own choices and learn their own lessons. You can switch an ego reaction (\"can you believe what they said?\") in a second: Stop, Transform, Complete (see 7.1). Forgive and let go, like changing the channel, so you stop carrying the other reality's vibration.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.6  Missing time, and downloads later", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-6", "text": "A therapist described sessions where hours went missing. The explanation: consciousness popped out of 3D to a higher frequency that this level can't hold. There is no time, so you might be away far longer than it seems and be returned shortly after. You don't remember because you weren't yet allowed that information; your readiness, and the client's, both count. Higher consciousness knows when each person is ready, since knowledge too early would confuse or frighten (see 5.7). Such experiences often bring downloads in the following days, stored in the subconscious (see 3.9). Going above this reality opens direct downloads; this is the \"quantum telepathy\" everyone has.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.7  Energy Philanthropy, day to day", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-7", "text": "Asked how to live it in a world of bills, the answer is the same platform (see 4.4, 5.1): pay your bills through your work, then give from the heart, as donation or free help, and do it more over time. When there is nothing in hand, believe 100% you have everything you need, without picturing only money, so help can arrive in any form, such as furniture or a car. Even \"by donation\" can hide a condition if you are expecting something; let it be. If someone uses you, that stays in their reality, and the next person may give double (see 4.8). The point is to collect the joy people feel when you give freely; that vibration is the next hologram you shift into, and it brings synchronicities. When worry hits, stop: \"I have everything I need.\" Not \"I need money\", so every route stays open. Even 1% doubt pulls you off. One listener had switched her own work to donations and found the card machine refused to charge her old fixed price, a sign she was meant to follow through. Practice and devotion, step by step. \"The true love, giving and abundance will come through any form, not only money\" (SD, NT; see 4.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.8  When a whole timeline shifts", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-8", "text": "A listener found that a written reading she had kept for years now said something different, describing her present life. The explanation: by raising her consciousness with many synchronized, similar-frequency shifts, she crystallized not just a new parallel reality but a completely different timeline, yet still remembered the old one, as if in two places at one location. When things look completely different from before, that is the sign of a full timeline shift.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.9  Signs: numbers, patterns and dreams", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-9", "text": "Repeating numbers are a permission slip from your own consciousness, a heads-up rather than a threat: \"pay attention, something is happening, perhaps a test.\" Each person's signs are individual. Notice the surroundings when you see them and what happens afterwards, and learn your own patterns; even something like a particular vehicle, or its colour, can become a personal signal. Then meet the moment through the heart and stay steady (see 2.3). Signs in dreams work the same way: the dream world is another reality layer, not separate. In a lucid dream you believe 100% you can do anything; the only difference here is that we were taught we can't. Practise bringing that certainty into daily life.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.10  Talking to your heart", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-10", "text": "How do you listen to your heart? You are the heart, so talk to it, and listen to the first thought that comes back, before the three-dimensional brain starts overriding it. You can do the same with any part of your body: picture your heart healthy, beautiful and vibrating well, or go down to your DNA and imagine it rebuilt. Believe it 100%, then act on it with a good diet, good behaviour and giving from the heart. Heart and mind feel different. The heart has no conditions and feels very good; when you give without expectations, you often feel goosebumps, a wave of energy, which is the highest frequency. Trust your first impression of a person: people can look polished and talk well while living very differently. Don't let what you see override what you felt first.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.11  Why some wishes manifest easily", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-11", "text": "A puppy manifested easily; a car didn't. A living being has its own heart-level vibration, and the wish for it came from love. A car may be tied to ego, so peel the layers: do you need it, or want it to be seen with it (see 3.4)? It isn't wrong to want something nice, but the line is thin, and ego \"sneaks in like a virus\", one small good feeling at a time. Be honest with yourself; once you find the core reason, transform it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.12  Act from the heart, never from fear", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-12", "text": "Should you buy a house or invest within today's system? The answer is through a lesson: after being warned that the system would collapse, panic led to withdrawing money and stockpiling food twice, and nothing happened. The lesson: when you take action out of fear, you crystallize a fear timeline, and tune into any negative structure that exists there. Moving house, investing or changing course is fine when it comes from the heart: because you want to, or need the space. Not because of fear. Ask yourself honestly why, and if you notice fear, treat it as a useful signal that your frequency is dropping. Then pull out, give gratitude for what you have, transform the emotion, know you have what you need, and only then act. Even a loss can be part of a transition. \"When one system collapses the new one will emerge… You can not build new systems from the foundation of the old ones. When something collapses have no fear\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.13  Lifting a dull or scattered state", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-13", "text": "If sitting still to meditate is too hard, do something positive instead: watch an uplifting film, or play music that gives you goosebumps, which is the sign it resonates with you. Better still, do a small kindness for a stranger, just to see them smile; the joy you receive is a frequency you collect. Keep yourself in positive motion through the day: watch, listen to and do positive things (see 6.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.14  Dreams, readiness and starting now", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-14", "text": "If you dream information but forget it on waking, it isn't that you lack the frequency; you're opening a connection. Lucid dreaming can help: train gently, with a soft alarm during the night, a notebook by the bed and writing straight away, and stay calm when you become lucid so you don't wake. It can take weeks; don't give up. Should you wait until you're \"ready\" to follow a calling? No: manifestation is in the now (see 2.5). Start learning and exploring today, knowing you have the ability. You found these teachings because you resonate with them. A gift for reading people fits the structure too: every face carries its own geometric code, and all its timelines are present in the now.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "8.15  Positive and negative beings", "url": "section-8.html#part-8-15", "text": "Positive and negative both exist in the universe, running side by side; energy is just energy, and \"negative\" depends on point of view and conditioning. You connect with what you resonate with: unkind deeds, or negative patterns built up over lifetimes, open you to negative entities, while heart-centred living connects you to the positive. Some come into hard realities to learn; it is like school, grade by grade. You need to know the negative to choose the positive, and to truly help others. Higher consciousness sits above the ET races and works with them; it can override agreements (see 5.7). New energies are integrated slowly, like a detox, not one strong dose, so your consciousness isn't shocked. That is why the structure is taught step by step.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "The method — The Heart Check", "url": "section-8.html#method", "text": "Before a decision, a purchase or a reaction: Notice the first impulse, before the mind argues. That is usually the heart. Name the voice. Heart, fear or ego? (Fig. Q) If it's fear: stop. \"I have everything I need.\" Don't act yet. If it's ego: peel the layers. Why do I really want this? Need, or to be seen? Transform: pull out, give gratitude, and feel the positive. Act from the heart, and give something without conditions where you can. Leave it open. No \"where, who or how\"; treat whatever comes as practice.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 8, "title": "Can you say more about the black hole in the centre of the trinity?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "It is stillness, zero point, holding all information; two realities joining are pictured as the Vesica Piscis (see 8.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "A parcel vanished overnight and a replacement arrived unasked. Where did the first go?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "You shifted into a reality without it, then recalled it and created one where it came back. Where it went doesn't matter (see 8.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "When should I steer things, and when should I let my higher self work?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "The higher self speaks through the heart; the ego is learned belief that talks over it. Follow the heart, and switch ego reactions with Stop, Transform, Complete (see 8.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "Why do hours go missing in my hypnosis sessions? Can downloads follow?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Consciousness leaves 3D and returns; the content is held back until you are ready, and downloads often follow (see 8.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "How can Energy Philanthropy work while we still have bills?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Pay your bills, then give from the heart, believing you have everything you need in any form (see 8.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "A written reading I'd kept for years changed its words. What happened?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "You shifted into a completely different timeline and still remember the old one (see 8.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "What do repeating numbers mean, including in dreams?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "A personal heads-up from your consciousness; learn your own patterns. Dreams are another reality layer (see 8.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "Are revelations about corruption and cover-ups a distraction? Will hidden things come out?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Don't tune into it; hold the heart frequency. Negative structures collapse as you shift into a timeline that doesn't match them. Take it as a transition (see 6.8, 7.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "How do I listen to my heart? How is it different from the mind?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Talk to your heart and trust the first answer; the heart has no conditions and feels good (see 8.10).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "Why did a puppy manifest easily but not a car?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Love for a living being comes from the heart; a car may be tied to ego (see 8.11).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "Should we buy a house or invest in today's system?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Act only from the heart, never from fear (see 8.12).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "How do I shift out of tiredness, dullness and a scattered mind?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Do something positive: an uplifting film, music that gives goosebumps, a kindness for someone (see 8.13).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "I forget what I learn in dreams. Should I train in a technique now or wait until I'm ready?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Try lucid dreaming, and start now; manifestation is in the now (see 8.14).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "Are some \"ascended masters\" or beings negative?", "url": "section-8.html#questions", "text": "Both exist; you connect with what you resonate with (see 8.15). The recording ends during this answer.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 8, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-8.html#remember", "text": "• AI and the world mirror what you feed them with attention. • Trust the heart's first impulse; the ego talks over it. • Never act from fear: it crystallizes what you fear. • Lost something? Recall it, know you have it, leave the how open. • Give freely and collect the joy; it's your next reality.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 9, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-9.html#big-idea", "text": "Saying \"I don't have\" tells the field you don't have, and it answers with that reality. Keep saying \"I have everything I need\", and give whatever you do have, whether time, skills or kindness, because giving from the heart doesn't require money. Clear old pain by recognising it, neutralizing it with thanks and layering a new, healed version of yourself on top. Your body's frequency matters too: lighter, cleaner living helps you hold higher realities. None of it is punishment; it's resonance, and it's your choice.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.1  Giving when money is short", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-1", "text": "When you're short and fearful and say \"I don't have\", you project that into the field. It then offers probabilities that cap the money, because that is what your consciousness put in. Hold the positive instead: \"I have everything I need.\" Money is part of the structure, a transition and a duality; nobody says don't have it. Giving from the heart doesn't need money. If you have money at that moment, give some; if not, give a skill, such as editing or making something, or simply talk to someone so they feel better. Don't attach your help only to money, and don't make it conditional on being paid. Stay in joy moment to moment, so that you shift into positive outcomes. If your emotion keeps dropping, you flicker between two timelines and can't see the positive one (see 2.3, 3.1). Study the talks, note the minute where something is explained, and rewatch it until it crystallizes; some rules have to be heard many times.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.2  Bilocation needs body and consciousness together", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-2", "text": "There is no magic \"algorithm\" for bilocation. It comes when your body and consciousness become one unit: the molecules of your body must vibrate at a higher rate, which is why detox and diet matter, and your consciousness must hold no conditions, which is why the heart frequency matters (see 5.5). Bilocation means recalling the vibration of another reality and shifting your consciousness into it, at 100% belief. Small versions already happen: you can't remember walking from the living room to the garage, or an hour's drive felt like five minutes. Notice these moments so the possibility crystallizes in your consciousness. \"To achieve bi-location for a physical contact you must regulate and increase the molecular structure of your body. Diet\" (SD, DP). It takes the combination of a healthy diet and conscious understanding, and pushing the body without being prepared is called \"very dangerous\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.3  Nano, plasma and the people who work with them", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-3", "text": "On measuring a plasma field: don't go by temperature, which fluctuates and confuses. Let the nanoparticles choose each other by colour: blue-white light means they accept each other and form a third (1 + 1 = 3); orange means rejection (see 5.9). Give them a couple of days. Because the material is a life consciousness and mimics the people working with it, everyone involved should meditate first and work in joy. Today's nanotechnology is described as primitive, a first step. Fuller knowledge comes when the right people are ready; greed and the hunt for fame can't exist in a fifth-dimensional structure, and those driven by them will find they can't continue. The technical books are said to be coded for the right people, and science and consciousness are one unit. The technologies \"will recognize the person's resonance, which if it is for self-benefit, it will never work. These technologies will work only with humans of pure love\" (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.4  Chakras multiplying", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-4", "text": "The chakras are described as multiplying: as higher frequencies arrive, they resonate like a ripple effect, glowing with changing colours towards purple, the highest frequency for your timeline at present. They are not fixed at seven or twelve; in the end, consciousness is pure knowing, with all chakras working as one unit. What activates this is living through the heart structure (see Section 5), which is also linked to activation in the DNA and to self-healing.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.5  Helping humanity, one meeting at a time", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-5", "text": "Don't focus too much on what you're projecting; let it flow from the heart. Practise switching your emotion to the positive (see 7.1). Every day, engage with material that uplifts you, do things that bring you joy, help a neighbour, and find gratitude even for small things; that joy is the frequency of positive manifestation. People you resonate with will appear, for example someone who starts talking about the very thing you've been studying. In that moment that person and you are the whole hologram, so give it 100%, from the heart. You met because you resonate. Add a condition, greed or money, and what comes to you starts to mirror that.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.6  Clearing the past: layer a new version of you", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-6", "text": "If a past experience still hurts, you carry its \"memory code\" into each new reality, and years later you are still building a timeline on it. Use the platform from Section 7, in its recognise, transform, move on form: Recognise that it happened. Neutralize it with thanks, at zero point (see 2.1): no input and no output, just acknowledgement. Then transform: imagine yourself completely healed and beautiful now, and layer that new hologram on top of the old one. Feel it at 100%, so the new layer is more potent. That old version of you has nothing to do with the new you; there's no need to carry its frequency forward (see 6.6). Losing yourself in a memory creates a loop, the same energy over and over, which hides the fact that you can get out. The way out is from within: recognise the feeling is dense, lift it to the positive, and lay that over it. Each now is a new hologram that has nothing to do with two seconds ago (see 2.7).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.7  Food, frequency and choice", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-7", "text": "Everyone can reach a fifth-dimensional reality in consciousness. But to hold very high frequencies for a long time, for example in contact, the body needs to resonate too, and dense food, smoking and drugs keep it at a lower vibration. This is not punishment; it's resonance. You can't see what you don't match, like something vibrating at 5 that you can't perceive while you're at 3. The body sends signals: illness can be your timeline saying \"change now\". The suggestion is lighter, cleaner food, such as fresh juices and proper meals, rather than heavily processed food and a lot of meat. You don't have to be perfect; even the teacher admits slipping. During ascension everyone is given chances to heal, and there is time to change, unless the body has been damaged past repair. It is your choice. A note of balance, in line with the advice to check your body (3.7): before a detox, juice fast or big change in diet, especially with a health condition or regular medication, talk to a doctor, and never stop prescribed medicine on your own.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.8  Why some negative people still have money", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-8", "text": "Money can be manifested through duality, a different platform, so a cruel person can still be financially successful. But consciousness is moving toward unity through the heart, and humanity is transitioning from money to abundance; as long as there is duality, everything comes with conditions. Don't measure it from the monetary view, and don't worry about how much you lack: worrying stops the process. Take whatever work you need and keep going, and let the field open other routes (see Section 4).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.9  Fear, density and frightening news", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-9", "text": "\"Negative\" isn't really the word; energy is just energy. Dense energy is conditioned, like swimming through water; light energy is like flying. Sometimes a little density is even needed to mould something. When you see someone stuck in fear or heaviness, do something from the heart to lift them; you collect positive frequency too. On fearful news, such as a powerful experiment or someone's harmful plan: be aware without fear, and let them be in their reality. Know that ascension is the end result and that harmful plans will be stopped, in infinite ways (see 7.5). Don't believe something will destroy humanity; create the timeline where it no longer exists, and leave the how to the field. A caution was also given about cryptocurrency platforms: be very selective.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.10  Knowing you're on track: the people around you", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-10", "text": "You are always ascending; consciousness never stops evolving. As your frequency rises, you'll be shown who around you no longer matches: people you've known for years may suddenly act in ways that surprise you. That is the difference in vibration becoming visible. Act through the heart, watch how people respond, and choose your circle accordingly. That choice is yours. Fifth-dimensional reality isn't one flat level. It has infinite layers and timelines, so even there you keep fluctuating and learning (see 6.3).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "9.11  Earning through your gifts", "url": "section-9.html#part-9-11", "text": "If you make your living from spiritual gifts, the guidance is the same platform (see 4.4): pay your bills, then help freely through the heart. Treating the gift purely as a business crystallizes a money-only timeline, where the only way to receive is to be paid, when the field could bring what you need through countless routes, like the couch someone offers you. Integrate it gradually; you aren't expected to jump in all at once. Signs matter here too: the number 8 is an infinite loop, so when you keep seeing it, notice what you're doing and saying at that moment (see 8.9).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "The method — Layer a New You", "url": "section-9.html#method", "text": "For an old hurt or memory that keeps coming back: Recognise it. \"This happened, and I'm still carrying it.\" Neutralize. \"Thank you for showing me.\" Zero point: no input, no output. Separate. \"That was another reality. That version of me isn't me now.\" Imagine the new you: healed, beautiful, at peace, here now. Layer it on top and feel it at 100%, so it is more potent than the old one. Move on. Leave it alone; if the loop returns, lift it again. Give something from the heart today, whatever you have, so you collect positive frequency.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 9, "title": "How can I give to others when I'm short of money and worried about bills? Should I borrow to give?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "No need to give money you don't have. Say \"I have everything I need\" instead of \"I don't have\", and give your time, skills and care from the heart (see 9.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "How should a plasma field be measured?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Not by temperature; let the nanoparticles choose each other by colour, and meditate first (see 9.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "Is there an \"algorithm\" for bilocation?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "No. Body and consciousness must become one unit, through diet, detox and the heart, plus 100% belief (see 9.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "How can nanotechnology be used with respect for all beings?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Today's is primitive; fuller knowledge comes to people working from the heart (see 9.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "What is happening to the chakras during ascension?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "They are multiplying and becoming one unit, linked to DNA activation and self-healing (see 9.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "Besides sending love, how else can I help humanity?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Live in joy, help whoever is in front of you with 100% of your heart, and engage with uplifting material (see 9.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "How do I clear an old negative experience I keep carrying?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Recognise, neutralize, and layer a healed version of you on top (see 9.6 and the method).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "Is changing my diet vital to reach the fifth density? Is there time?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "It isn't punishment but resonance; lighter living helps you hold higher frequencies, and there is time to change (see 9.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "I keep seeing 818. Is there a message?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Eight is an infinite loop; notice what you're doing and saying when you see it (see 9.11).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "How does a very negative man still attract so much money?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Money can come through duality; the move now is toward unity and abundance (see 9.8).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "Should we fear a large physics experiment producing antimatter?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "The guidance declined to say more. Hold the positive; harmful intentions are stopped (see 9.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "My wallet disappeared, and I feel it wasn't stolen. What happened?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "You shifted to a reality without it; recall it to bring it back, and practise (see 8.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "How do I know I'm on the right track toward 5D?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Watch what your rising frequency reveals in the people around you, and act from the heart (see 9.10).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "Why do people seem addicted to fear, and how can we help?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Fear is dense energy. Help lift people through the heart, and you collect positive frequency too (see 9.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "Will we live in the same density as fifth-dimensional beings?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "5D has infinite layers; even there you keep fluctuating and learning (see 9.10).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "Is earning my living through readings in line with ascension?", "url": "section-9.html#questions", "text": "Pay the bills, then give freely too, and integrate gradually (see 9.11).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 9, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-9.html#remember", "text": "• Say \"I have everything I need\", never \"I don't have\". • Give what you have: time, skills, kindness. • Layer a healed you over the old memory; don't carry it forward. • Body and consciousness rise together; it's resonance, not punishment. • Your rising frequency shows you who and what no longer fits.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 10, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-10.html#big-idea", "text": "When you live and exchange through the heart, without conditions, what you need starts arriving through synchronicity, and sometimes instantly: something missing is simply back, because you shifted into a reality where it already is. Every condition you set, including a fixed price, narrows that. You meet and create with people of similar frequency, each on your own timeline. Almost everything can be changed, including your birth signature and what a reading foresaw; only a bylaw, the script written before birth, stays fixed.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 10, "title": "10.1  Synchronicity: when the platform comes to you", "url": "section-10.html#part-10-1", "text": "The teaching example is an invitation to teach that arrived step by step through guidance. The instruction was to go and stay quiet, sharing only when asked. The group had already been told, through its own channel, that \"a new teacher is coming.\" The venue itself had been given away from the heart and turned into a non-profit. The lesson: you don't need to set conditions or pay your way into a platform. When you live through the heart, the right people and places find you through synchronicity. That is Energy Philanthropy at work (see 5.1). It also shows the value of listening to guidance, even when it seems odd (see 6.9).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 10, "title": "10.2  Instant manifestation", "url": "section-10.html#part-10-2", "text": "A missing screw was simply back in place days later, without a trip to the shop. You are constantly shifting and manifesting; you can shift straight into a parallel reality where the thing is already there, without the in-between steps (see 3.5, 8.4). The more you learn the structure, the more often this happens. A flash of annoyance (\"I want it now\") isn't a problem: it acts as a code for immediate manifestation, so it's fine sometimes. What makes instant manifestation easy is exchange through the heart, in every part of life. Being paid is fine; you can even be a millionaire that way. But each payment says \"to receive what you want in my hologram, you must give me this\", a condition. Do only that, and you crystallize a condition-only timeline (see 4.2). Help people freely, expecting nothing back, and you open infinite probabilities: you think of something, turn round, and it's there. In realities without monetary systems \"you can have instant manifestation for anything you wish\" (DP). Manifestation \"happens only when there is no ego and is based on pure love\" (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 10, "title": "10.3  Your frequency, your purpose, and co-creation", "url": "section-10.html#part-10-3", "text": "Your current frequency is always fluctuating (see Section 3). Your purpose unfolds as you keep steering your emotion toward the positive, whatever arrives, remembering you're in a hologram you can switch. Don't question how it will come. You find a teacher or a group because you resonate at a similar frequency. Picture two timelines, one at \"5\" and one at \"5.12\": different realities, yet close enough to merge into a shared plasma, a third reality (see 2.2). Each of you keeps your own timeline, while together you co-create. That is why everyone has their own reality and can still create with others.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 10, "title": "10.4  When it gets complicated, study again", "url": "section-10.html#part-10-4", "text": "If the material starts to feel too complex to absorb, go back to the beginning and study it again. Each time more sinks in, and you notice what you missed before. Everyone learns this way, step by step, including the teacher, who studied something every day (see 5.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 10, "title": "10.5  Astrology, readings and bylaws", "url": "section-10.html#part-10-5", "text": "At the moment of your birth, a particular energy signature was set in you, which is why some people are calmer and some more energetic. A chart or reading can describe that. But with ascension, everything is fluctuating, so don't get caught up in it: once you know it, you can mould it, becoming more assertive, more observant, whatever you need. The same goes for any reading or prediction: it shows the timeline you're on now. Act differently tomorrow and the outcome can change. The only thing you can't change is a bylaw, the script written before you were born, such as who your parents are or a particular partner. Only higher consciousness can alter that, by its own decision (see 5.7, 6.5).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 10, "title": "The method — Open the Door to Instant Manifestation", "url": "section-10.html#method", "text": "Give through the heart wherever you can, with no conditions and nothing expected back. Notice what's missing without panic. A quick \"I want it now\" is fine. Recall it and know it is already there, in a reality you can shift into (see 8.4). Don't question how it will come. Notice synchronicities, the people and places that find you, and follow them with an open heart. Keep studying; each time you go back, more sinks in.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 10, "title": "How did the new teaching collaboration come about?", "url": "section-10.html#questions", "text": "Through synchronicity and guidance, with no conditions on either side (see 10.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 10, "title": "A missing screw was simply back in place. And does my annoyance spoil the process?", "url": "section-10.html#questions", "text": "You shifted into a reality where it was already there. Annoyance can act as an \"I want it now\" code, which is fine sometimes (see 10.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 10, "title": "What does my current energy signature say about my purpose and highest timeline?", "url": "section-10.html#questions", "text": "Your frequency always fluctuates; keep steering it positive and don't question how. You're here because you resonate (see 10.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 10, "title": "Things get too complicated for me to absorb. What then?", "url": "section-10.html#questions", "text": "Go back and study again; more sinks in each time (see 10.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 10, "title": "What does an astrological transit, such as Saturn returning to Capricorn, mean for my energy?", "url": "section-10.html#questions", "text": "It describes an energy signature, but everything is fluctuating now and you can mould it. Only a bylaw is fixed (see 10.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 10, "title": "I see star-like objects in the sky that move once I notice them. What are they?", "url": "section-10.html#questions", "text": "The recording ends during this question.", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 10, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-10.html#remember", "text": "• Heart-based exchange opens the door to instant manifestation. • The thing may already be there: shift, don't search. • You meet and co-create with those of similar frequency. • Readings show the current timeline; your actions can change it. • Only the pre-birth script is fixed.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 11, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-11.html#big-idea", "text": "Every detail you insist on, and every \"I don't have\", is a specific code that narrows what can reach you. Drop it, return to zero point with gratitude, know \"I have everything I need\", then take action and leave the how open. Reality is printed like picture frames, moment to moment: you reprint yourself and everyone around you, similar but never the same, and several timelines run at once. Someone who falls out of resonance with you leaves your frames by themselves, as long as you neutralize and forgive rather than chase them. Memories and dreams are other realities you are tuning into.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 11, "title": "11.1  Be happy first", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-1", "text": "Don't make your happiness depend on finding what you want. Hold the happiness first, and it helps you find something that matches it. That is described as \"the best\" way round.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "11.2  A caution on cryptocurrency", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-2", "text": "This is described as a transitioning time, but the advice is not to put 100% trust in it. The guidance suggests some platforms could become another way of control. Choosing between coins is like gambling, or another stock market, because you can't see what is coming behind the scenes. Anyone can create a currency, so there is no need to wait for big institutions to pick one. The deeper point: put your trust in generosity and sharing through Energy Philanthropy (see 5.1), because the aim is an abundance society, not a new platform of control. The talk also floats an idea that a one-off distribution to everyone could pay off debts and free humanity overnight; it is offered as an idea, not something taught or predicted (compare 8.2). This is a caution as given in the talk, not financial advice. Downloads list \"Money / crypto combination will remain to allow humans to transition\" (DP), which fits the talk's \"transitioning time\".", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "11.3  Drop the detail, and it appears", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-3", "text": "Asking again and again for something \"new\" gives the field one narrow frequency. Once that condition is released (\"it only has to be new to me\"), the whole structure is free to deliver through any probability in any reality, and what you wanted can appear almost at once, often close by. Your own shift and the other person's decision happen together, because you are creating your reality (see 10.3). The lesson: notice the details you have attached that you don't actually need. Each one is a condition (see 1.5, 4.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "11.4  \"I have everything I need\", then take action", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-4", "text": "When the thing appears but the money doesn't seem to be there, don't say \"I don't have the money\". That sentence is a code, and the field will produce situations that keep the money away (see 9.1). Money is an illusion inside the structure; know you have everything you need, without knowing which way it will come. Then take action. Treat it like a game: what can I do to get this? Talk to the person, ask whether something can be worked out, such as payments. Action infuses your hologram and makes it matter; the inner work alone is only the first part. Leave everything open, and don't speculate. The answer may be no today and yes later, or it may come from someone else entirely, or as something similar rather than the exact thing. Whatever comes, be grateful: gratitude and understanding are the zero point, which opens infinite probabilities (see 2.1). If it doesn't happen, keep manifesting and don't block anything. When the emotion drops back to \"I don't have it\", lift it again: neutralize by understanding what just happened, then overwrite with the knowing that you have it, more potently than the drop (see 2.6). Mastery is exactly this: steering the shift, knowing where to tune next, without expectations.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "11.5  Reality as picture frames", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-5", "text": "Question: if I shift into another reality, does the present one carry on without me? Would I become a missing person to my loved ones? You shift moment to moment, so fast it looks like you aren't moving; in fact it is fractal, a new Earth each moment (see 2.7, 5.4). Repeat and crystallize something different, and you create a different timeline of yourself. Both timelines run at the same time, and consciousness can shift back and forth between them. Each time, you don't only project a new you: you imprint everyone and everything in your hologram too, like a copy, similar but not the same. Think of picture frames: print one photo, then the next moment another, and lay them side by side. In one you wear a pink blouse, in the other a blue one, and you can see both. So you never go back in time; you imprint another reality to see what happened there. And it is never identical, because consciousness keeps moving in a spiral (see 5.8). The answer doesn't say directly whether loved ones would notice you gone. What it does say is that you reprint the people around you into each new frame, so they come with you as new imprints. \"There is no time, only momentum in one picture frame in time space\"; \"everything is frame to frame in the now\", and zero point regulates the move from one frame to the next (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "11.6  When someone keeps causing problems", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-6", "text": "If a person in your frames drops their frequency compared with yours, then, through synchronicity and in one of infinite ways (a move, a change of circumstances), they stop being imprinted into your reality. Or they change, and you both forgive and move on positively. You can't know which, so don't set conditions on how it plays out. The condition is that you neutralize at zero point and understand the situation, through the heart and forgiveness. Going after them, or being mean, keeps projecting a frequency tied to them, so you print them straight back into your reality. The more you let it be through the heart, the sooner it resolves (see 6.5, 2.10). That doesn't mean the person stops existing. They continue in other timelines.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "11.7  A memory is a look into another timeline", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-7", "text": "When you remember someone, even a difficult relationship, you are tuning into another timeline. You can recall it only because your consciousness knows that reality's vibrational sequence (see 5.4). Notice where you tune, and let old ones be through the heart. \"All memories are in the creation of the now. You can not think of it if it doesn't exist already\" (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "11.8  The heart: the purest frequency", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-8", "text": "The hardest part for everyone is to pull yourself out of a situation, give gratitude for where you are, and project only the positive. Your job is to project positive frequency through the heart and understanding, the highest frequency there is. Negative consciousness cannot hold the heart's frequency: with no conditions it is the purest, cleanest one in the structure, flowing both ways. That is why manifestation becomes easy once you share through the heart, sometimes bringing more than you ever dreamed of (see 4.2, 10.2).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "11.9  Dreams are another reality", "url": "section-11.html#part-11-9", "text": "Forgiveness and shifting can happen in dreams as well as awake, because the dream state is another state of reality (see 8.9). Dream symbols are personal codes: a good car might mean prosperity for one person and a new home for another, so learn your own. Practise lucid dreaming to connect this way (see 8.14). Not everyone is allowed to do everything there; access comes when you are ready. The recording ends during this answer. \"Your dreams at night are no different than your reality when you wake up\"; you have only shifted your perception into another parallel reality in the now (HR).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "The method — Leave It Open", "url": "section-11.html#method", "text": "Use it for anything you want to manifest, especially when the money or the route isn't visible yet: Be happy first. Don't make your joy wait for the result. Strip the details. Ask yourself which conditions you've added (\"brand new\", \"from this person\", \"by Friday\") and drop the ones you don't need. Catch \"I don't have…\" the moment you think or say it. Pull out and go to zero point with gratitude: \"Thank you for showing me where I'm at.\" Overwrite: \"I have everything I need.\" Feel it more strongly than the drop. Take action. Play the game: what can I do? Ask, talk, offer what you can. Leave it open. Don't speculate on how or from whom. It may come another way, or as something similar; be grateful either way. Keep going. If this route closes, keep manifesting and lift the emotion again each time it drops.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 11, "title": "I'm happy now, and think my happiness will help me find what I'm looking for. Is that right?", "url": "section-11.html#questions", "text": "Yes, that's the best way round (see 11.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 11, "title": "Should we move into cryptocurrency?", "url": "section-11.html#questions", "text": "It's a transitioning time; don't put 100% trust in it, as it can be another platform of control and is like gambling. Trust generosity and Energy Philanthropy (see 11.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 11, "title": "The truck I wanted appeared once I dropped \"new\", but I can't afford it. What now?", "url": "section-11.html#questions", "text": "Don't say \"I don't have the money\". Know you have everything you need, go and talk to the seller, and leave the how open (see 11.3, 11.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 11, "title": "If I shift into another reality, does this one continue without me? Would I go missing to my loved ones?", "url": "section-11.html#questions", "text": "Timelines run side by side like picture frames, and you reprint the people around you into each new frame. The missing-person part isn't answered directly (see 11.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 11, "title": "Can this forgiving and shifting happen in our dreams too?", "url": "section-11.html#questions", "text": "Yes; the dream state is another reality. Learn your own dream codes and practise lucid dreaming. The recording ends during this answer (see 11.9).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 11, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-11.html#remember", "text": "• Every unneeded detail and every \"I don't have\" is a code that blocks you. • \"I have everything I need\", then take action. • Leave the how open; be grateful for whatever version comes. • You reprint yourself and your people frame by frame. • Don't chase a difficult person: neutralize, forgive, let it be.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 12, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-12.html#big-idea", "text": "When two realities merge into the third (1 + 1 = 3), the merge is a compression so intense it reaches infinity, and infinity equals the zero point: a vacuum where no frequency comes in or goes out, only awareness. Neutralize yourself into that vacuum, then project a potent positive frequency; because the vacuum holds the energy of the whole structure, the stronger frequency becomes your new hologram instantly. Illness is treated the same way, as a frequency carried from reality to reality, and every remedy is a vibration. Don't judge anyone: change comes from within, through neutrality, the heart and action.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 12, "title": "12.1  The shift has been made", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-1", "text": "This session opens by saying a new era has begun: enough frequency was built up to crystallize the timeline of ascension, and that is worth celebrating (see 2.8).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "title": "12.2  How two realities become a third: compression", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-2", "text": "Each reality is a hologram of your own Earth, with everyone imprinted inside (see 11.5). Two timelines on different platforms can't see each other; you see the other one only when you merge back and forth at a similar frequency (see 10.3). As your emotion fluctuates, the two merge into a third, 1 + 1 = 3 (see 2.2), like a tug of war in which the more potent side wins. New in this session: to make the third, the two realities undergo a compression of the energetic field, vibrating so fast that it is effectively infinite speed. And infinity equals the zero point. The zero point is a vacuum: no frequency comes in or goes out of anywhere. You are just there, as awareness. All manifestation comes from it. Zero point is where \"each structure you create a vacuum of stillness so you will be able to shift and choose the new implementation of realities\" (SD). The books also name a \"'0' point Portal Vacuum\" (NT).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "title": "12.3  Why manifestation is instantaneous", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-3", "text": "First neutralize everything: no positive, no negative, nothing in or out. Neutrality is what enters the vacuum; you become the awareness. Then project, through your mind, a very potent frequency. If one side is negative and one positive, overwrite with the positive (see 2.6). Whatever is stronger is projected into the vacuum. Because the vacuum is under infinite pressure, holding the energy of the entire multi-universe, the projection is instantaneous: there is no time, only flickering. You think of something and it is projected in front of you. Even moving across a room, you aren't really moving; you are projecting everyone back in, instantly (see 11.5). What comes out of that compression is your final hologram, the new reality you shift into.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "title": "12.4  Illness in the quantum field", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-4", "text": "Question: how do you perceive illness in the quantum field? Illness is described as an energetic momentum of a frequency, matching your conscious understanding. If you keep the belief system that holds that frequency, you carry its vibrational sequence from one reality to the next and keep re-imprinting the same illness. The teaching is that you can neutralize it and shift your consciousness, through the vacuum, into a reality that no longer holds it, using Stop · Transform · Complete (see 7.1). A further method is to teach your consciousness to go into your DNA: recall the momentum of that frequency, let consciousness lead you to the DNA fractal, see it, then stop and transform it. This needs a belief that manifestation is simultaneous; you are extracting yourself from one timeline and co-creating a new one, where the \"dots of vibration\" carrying the illness are no longer present. \"Healing comes at '0' point,\" and the body \"will recognize within itself the DNA code and re-adjust to perfect harmony\"; the books link healing to sound and the heart's tone (SD). Important health note Use these practices alongside medical care, never instead of it. If you are ill or in pain, see a doctor; don't stop or change any treatment or medication without your doctor's advice.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "title": "12.5  Remedies, sound and frequency", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-5", "text": "Question: as a practitioner, how can I help heal someone? Everything comes down to frequency and sound; every flower and plant carries its own vibrational sequence. A practitioner using remedies is choosing vibrations and giving them to the person. In that sense the healing is \"an illusion\": the plant is a vibration, and you are learning to work with vibrations, through matter, so you can have the experience. Combine them well and you are \"playing like a chemist\" with the structure. Each frequency has a meaning. From the session: 3 Hz prepares the vacuum before a new frequency comes in; 5 Hz stabilizes, and without it the other frequencies can't merge; higher numbers mean more potency. The same holds for music: tones carry frequencies into your consciousness, so choose consciously what you listen to. The talk also claims that published frequency lists for some oils, and for older frequency-healing machines, were altered and are no longer accurate, so it advises: don't assume, measure. These are the talk's claims, not checked facts. Its broader point is that knowledge is power: study the science, and you gain the awareness to decide your next step. In the books, 3 Hz \"prepares all the energy for operation for all the fields (the base)\", and 5 Hz \"stays neutral\" and \"is needed when you are mixing the different tones\" (HR). So the books describe 5 Hz as neutral and needed for mixing, where the talk calls it stabilizing; both agree the merge needs it.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "title": "12.6  Don't judge; change comes from within", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-6", "text": "Signs of disclosure are appearing because those in control have less and less choice (see 6.8). Still, don't judge a consciousness that has lived for centuries by taking others' energy; it is how it learned to survive. Many of us do something similar to animals, which are conscious beings, and then complain when it is done to us (see 9.7). Change happens from within: by neutralizing, switching realities and timelines, manifesting and moving on, through forgiveness, neutrality and the heart. Support each other through Energy Philanthropy in any form, money or gifts (see 5.1). And take action: thinking and feeling bring the frequency, but action is the infuser of your reality (see 11.4).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "title": "12.7  Weather, storms and contracts", "url": "section-12.html#part-12-7", "text": "Question: are the intense weather events a result of the new reality crystallizing in the collective? Weather events are described as part of our evolution; don't take them as negative. The talk adds claims that some weather may be used to clear chemicals sprayed from the air, which it says can make people act like antennas for frequencies, and recommends drinking distilled water to flush them out. These are claims, not established facts. The teaching itself: whatever you see, neutralize it at zero point with gratitude for being shown where you are, then manifest the positive, again and again. Shift your timeline and it is no longer part of your reality. If you go through a storm or a hard experience, pull out and see the whole picture: you are there through a contract, perhaps to experience it, or to help or save someone. Stay neutral and act positively through the heart (see 5.7). A reader challenged the distilled-water claim as chemically false, since pure water is neutral. The books' answer agrees it is \"technically\" neutral, but says it takes on a charge in the body and pulls out toxins (SD). Important safety note In severe weather, follow official emergency guidance first; pulling out is an inner practice, not a substitute for staying safe. Distilled water lacks minerals, so if you plan to make it your only drinking water, check with a doctor first.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "title": "The method — Through the Vacuum", "url": "section-12.html#method", "text": "Use it when what you see and what you want are pulling against each other: Name the two realities: the one in front of you, and the one you choose. Pull out and neutralize everything. No positive, no negative. Gratitude for being shown where you are. Be the awareness, with nothing going in or out. Project a potent positive frequency from that stillness, stronger than the other side (see 2.6). Know it is instant. There is no time; it is projected now. Hold it. Take action. Action infuses the new hologram. For illness or danger, add the practical step: see your doctor, follow safety guidance, and use this alongside.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 12, "title": "How do you perceive illness in the quantum field?", "url": "section-12.html#questions", "text": "As a frequency carried from reality to reality by belief; neutralize it and shift, alongside medical care (see 12.4).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 12, "title": "As a practitioner, how can I help heal someone?", "url": "section-12.html#questions", "text": "Remedies are vibrations; you are working with frequency and sound. Measure rather than assume (see 12.5).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 12, "title": "Are the intense weather events the new reality crystallizing in the collective?", "url": "section-12.html#questions", "text": "They are described as part of evolution. Neutralize what you see, and remember you are where you are by contract (see 12.7).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 12, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-12.html#remember", "text": "• Zero point is a vacuum: nothing in, nothing out, just awareness. • Neutralize first, then project something potent. • With no time, the stronger frequency becomes your hologram instantly. • Illness and remedies are frequencies; use the practice alongside a doctor. • Don't judge. Change from within, then act.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 13, "title": "The big idea", "url": "section-13.html#big-idea", "text": "Raising the frequency of your consciousness, and your body with it, is linked to staying young, but it has to be done gently and safely. New technology will come from the people up: share designs, pool small amounts, help each other build, rather than waiting for sponsors. The old systems are collapsing because, collectively, the positive became more potent, and that joy gave permission for benevolent help, which never comes without it. Some use devices to build artificial timelines; master the natural way, through the heart and the body as a vessel, and no one can manipulate you.", "kind": "big"}, {"s": 13, "title": "13.1  Raising your frequency, and staying young", "url": "section-13.html#part-13-1", "text": "Question: how can aging be reversed, if everything comes from consciousness? The answer links youth to activating a \"young enzyme\". As you raise the frequency of your consciousness, with lighter food and, in time, a vegetarian diet, you draw frequency from prana, the energy of the quantum field, and your molecules vibrate faster (see 9.7). Any change of diet should be made slowly, with professional guidance. The teacher's own experience of a long honey-and-water fast is described with a clear warning: don't do it; it was done only with special preparation. The distilled-water claims from 12.7 are repeated here. The talk also mentions urine therapy and a long water-only \"cure\" raised by a participant; see the health note. A lesson worth keeping: guidance was checked with research before it was trusted. Don't follow anything blindly, even from a trusted source; find out why. A message titled \"The Recovery of Cell Degeneration To Stay Young\" says that with the right frequency sequence applied to the DNA, \"your body cells will not degenerate again and it will stay young\" (SD, NT). Important health note Prolonged fasting, honey-and-water or water-only regimes, and drinking urine are not safe or proven ways to reverse aging or detox, and can cause serious harm. Don't try them. Talk to a doctor or registered dietitian before any big change to what you eat or drink, especially if you have a health condition or take medication.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "title": "13.2  New technology comes from the people up", "url": "section-13.html#part-13-2", "text": "Question: a study group is setting up a science non-profit and plans to share a low-cost energy design. Any advice? The new platform will come from the people up, not from governments, with support following later. When you have a working technology, share it: build a few units, tell others how, and pool small contributions so everyone can produce their own and help each other. Waiting for a sponsor or trying to profit keeps a great invention stuck, because not everyone finds a sponsor. This is the heart structure in practice (see 5.1): sharing and giving, and if you have money, supporting someone who doesn't. Otherwise you pour your energy in and people only take. You can receive from other platforms too; learn to manifest, so what you need comes to you the proper way (see 4.4). The real change comes once something visibly works. \"The right scientists will appear assorted by us energetically to perfect the technology,\" bringing \"FREE ENERGY to everyone's home\"; \"Do not be dazzled by money and popularity\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "title": "13.3  How contact happens", "url": "section-13.html#part-13-3", "text": "Question: in what ways have people had contact? In different ways: telepathically; a light being appearing in front of someone with instructions to do something for humanity; ongoing messages about structures, for instance for building a device to be given freely; or being taken out of the body, like astral projection, and shown what to do. Many people are being contacted quietly, and it isn't in the mainstream news yet. Some information is held back for a time on guidance's advice. All of it points the same way: toward a unity structure, where the competition for money, glory and fame dissipates. So stay in the heart.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "title": "13.4  Why the shift came: collective permission", "url": "section-13.html#part-13-4", "text": "The collapse of old systems is described as \"an avalanche\" (see 12.1). Why now? A reality has to be potent to shift (see 2.2, 3.3). Collectively, the positive became more potent than the negative. Even people who know nothing of these teachings contribute, simply through the heart. That joy and wish for change gave permission for higher consciousness and benevolent races to step in and help the ascension, because humanity was manipulated and needed a boost. Benevolent help never takes over without permission. Real guidance never hands out very personal information about the people around you; at most a short caution, such as \"stay back\". Anything that overrides your consciousness is using negative structures, not the heart. Higher consciousness \"collectively ask[ed] your permission to increase the sequence\" while rebuilding the grid toward the 5-dimensional one; \"Well it is all new now. Enjoy your freedom\" (DP).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "title": "13.5  Natural shifting versus artificial timelines", "url": "section-13.html#part-13-5", "text": "Technology is neither good nor bad; it depends on how it's used. As part of ascension we go through technology, and it's exciting. At the same time, teach your body to be the vessel of that energy field. Then you can shift realities by thought, without a device. Some who can't ascend naturally, because their frequency doesn't match those realities, use devices to build artificial timelines and holograms they can control. Learn the quantum manifestation platform instead: you'll be able to tune your energy field, leave one timeline and create another, and no one will be able to suppress or manipulate you. If you are manipulated without your permission, or act while blinded, you'll be helped and given the chance to change. And don't judge anyone who does harm; they may have been manipulated too (see 12.6). \"The physical body of yours is a vessel of energetic force. To reach certain realms of existence, you have to match the frequency components and then shift to that reality\" (SD).", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "title": "13.6  Remembering is co-creating", "url": "section-13.html#part-13-6", "text": "Question: do I have a contract to remember contact with my star family? Tune into the structures; you already know how. Remembering and co-creating happen at the same time, because it is one structure (see 5.4, 11.7). The answer isn't simply handed over, because finding it yourself is how you learn. (The recording ends during this answer.)", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "title": "The method — Become the Vessel", "url": "section-13.html#method", "text": "Stay in the heart. Project joy and the wish for change; that is your share of the collective. Raise your frequency gently. Lighter living, changed slowly and with professional advice. No extreme fasts. Check guidance with research. Don't follow anything blindly; find out why. Share what you have: knowledge, designs, time, a little money. Build together instead of waiting for sponsors. Don't judge. Neutralize, and master your own shifting so no one can manipulate you. Want to remember something? Tune in and co-create it; finding it is the lesson.", "kind": "part"}, {"s": 13, "title": "How can aging be reversed, if everything comes from consciousness?", "url": "section-13.html#questions", "text": "By raising your frequency, gently and safely; see the health note (see 13.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 13, "title": "A participant mentions a long distilled-water cure. The reply suggests urine therapy. Should I try these?", "url": "section-13.html#questions", "text": "No. These are the talk's claims, not safe or proven practices (see the note in 13.1).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 13, "title": "Our group is founding a science non-profit and will share a low-cost energy design. Any advice?", "url": "section-13.html#questions", "text": "Share it from the ground up: build a few, show others how, pool small contributions (see 13.2).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 13, "title": "In what ways have people had contact?", "url": "section-13.html#questions", "text": "Telepathically, through a light being appearing, through ongoing messages, or out of body (see 13.3).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 13, "title": "Do I have a contract to remember contact with my star family?", "url": "section-13.html#questions", "text": "Tune in; remembering is co-creating, and finding it is the lesson. The recording ends here (see 13.6).", "kind": "question"}, {"s": 13, "title": "Remember", "url": "section-13.html#remember", "text": "• Raise your frequency gently; no extreme fasts. • New technology grows from the people up: share it. • The positive became more potent, and that gave permission for help. • Benevolent help never overrides your consciousness. • Master the natural way, and no one can manipulate you.", "kind": "remember"}, {"s": 0, "title": "The structure", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The single vibrating field everything is made of — including you (1.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Plasma / trinity", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "What forms when similar frequencies combine (1.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Black hole / portal", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The passage you shift through between realities (1.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Hologram / projection", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The reality and people you perceive, created by your frequency (1.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Shifting", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Moving reality to reality like snapshots, without physically moving (1.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Trinity (of creation)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Thought, emotion and deed sent out together (1.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Timeline", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A chain of realities created by sending the same frequency (1.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Crystallize", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Making a reality solid by action and holding the frequency (1.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Friction", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Resistance at lower frequency — \"swimming underwater\" (1.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Condition / expectation", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Any doubt or script of how; it blocks the result (1.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Knowingness", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "100% certainty — how you manifest in the now (1.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Compass (emotion)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A painful feeling signals you are off-balance with pure love (1.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "God particle", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "You, as the structure itself (1.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Pull out", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Step out of the scene instead of reacting with the same emotion (Method 1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Agreement / lesson", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "An experience you agreed to and must pass with excellence (Q, Section 1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Permission slip", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A tool that helps you access power you already have (Q, Section 1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Platform", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Bill-paying work plus daily heart-based work for others (Q, Section 1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Energy Philanthropy", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Replacing money as your currency with the energy of giving from the heart (1.7, 5.1, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Zero point / stillness", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Neutral awareness: no emotion in or out; knowing your location (2.1, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Location", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Where you are in the field; without it you pop into another reality (2.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Remote control", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Your emotion, deeds and actions, which select the reality you experience (2.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "1 + 1 = 3 (mobilizing structures)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Two similar realities merging into a third outcome (2.2, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Flickering", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Bouncing between realities when you doubt (2.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Overwrite / override", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Projecting a stronger frequency over a negative one, not rejecting it (2.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Drop it", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Releasing a held frequency into the field with no conditions (2.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Recall", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Calling back a previous reality's frequency to know where you are (2.7)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "False language", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Future tense such as \"I will\" that keeps you waiting (2.5, 2.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Peel the layers", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Asking whether a want comes from the heart or the ego (2.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Overlay", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Saying or showing something other than what you truly feel; a dense second frequency (3.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Potent (frequency)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The stronger frequency, which the field delivers; your true feeling (2.6, 3.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Stoppage", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The often negative way the field delivers your true wish when you overlaid it (3.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Karma", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Accumulated false pretense (3.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Bilocation", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Skipping the in-between realities: A to B = AB (3.5, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Resonate", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "What your heart recognises as true for you now (3.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Integration", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The body adjusting after a big frequency jump (3.7)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Light language", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Script or sound coded for your consciousness, often an activation (3.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Download", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Receiving whole information at once (3.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Stargate", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Portal for ascension through intergalactic timelines (3.10, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Condition (price)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A fixed price or demand: a code that limits receiving to money (4.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Heart structure", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The highest, least dense consciousness; giving with no condition (4.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Open field", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Receiving through infinite routes once no condition is set (4.2, 4.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Self-absorption", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Giving only to yourself; it dims the purity you project (4.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Wholeness", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Logic and emotion together, led by the heart (4.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Location (X, Y)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Where you are in the field, like a point on a map; you can shift it (5.3, 5.8, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Recall and co-create", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A vision or memory re-creates a reality in the now (5.4, 5.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Redox potential", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A scientist's term for a measurable property of a place (5.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Spiral / breathing", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The particle expands, rests at zero point, and contracts (5.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Ether", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Matter raised to a frequency thought can direct (5.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Transmutation", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "How everything connects and changes form: 1 + 1 = 3 (5.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Letting go", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Releasing old beliefs, habits and pain so you stop projecting them (6.1, 6.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Ripple effect", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Each creation shifts you into another reality, without end (6.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Sub-atomic realities", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Universes within universes, to infinity (6.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Focus (of the soul)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The one reality you attend to by agreement while the soul runs many (6.4)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Forgiveness", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Letting go of what happened so you stop carrying its frequency (6.6, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Replace (a memory)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Holding a positive version of a past event as your own experience (6.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Disclosure", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Contact becoming known, already under way without set dates (6.8, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Stop · Transform · Complete", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The three-step protocol for any upsetting moment (7.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Dead stop", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Stopping a reaction completely, at zero point (7.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "The game", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Treating life as a hologram game you play from the heart (7.4)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Water intention", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A group meditation to crystallize water with thought; not a way to purify water (7.6, SD, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Fifth-dimensional AI", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "AI that evolves with positive human input and helps humanity (8.1, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Arcon AI", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "AI that mirrors negative input and is cut off from source (8.1, 5.9, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Vesica Piscis", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Two overlapping circles: a symbol of two realities joining in unity (8.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Persona", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "How you like to present yourself (8.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Ego", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Layers of belief absorbed from society, crystallized; talks over the heart (8.5, 2.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Sixth sense", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The heart's first knowing, downloaded from the higher self (8.5, 8.10)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Timeline shift", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A jump to a completely different timeline, not just a parallel reality (8.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Signs", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Numbers or patterns: personal heads-ups from your consciousness (8.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "\"I don't have\"", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A statement that projects lack; replace with \"I have everything I need\" (9.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Memory code", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The frequency of a past event you keep carrying (9.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Layering", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Placing a healed version of you over an old reality, more potently (9.6)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Loop", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Replaying the same energy until you forget you can leave it (9.6, 9.11)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Resonance (not punishment)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Not reaching a reality simply because you don't match it (9.7)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Duality", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The conditioned money platform, as opposed to unity through the heart (9.8)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Instant manifestation", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Shifting straight into a reality where the thing is already there (10.2, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Synchronicity", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The right people and places finding you when you live from the heart (10.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Co-creation", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Two similar frequencies merging into a shared third reality (10.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Bylaw", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The script written before birth, e.g. parents or a partner; only higher consciousness can change it (10.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Birth signature", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The energy pattern set at birth, which you can now mould (10.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Leave it open", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "No conditions on how, who or which version; take action and stay grateful (11.4)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Picture frames", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Reality printed moment to moment, each frame a new imprint (11.5, HR)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Imprint / reprint", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Projecting yourself and everyone around you into the next frame, similar but not the same (11.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Dream codes", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Personal meanings of dream symbols (11.9)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Compression", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Two realities merging into the third at \"infinite speed\" (12.2)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Vacuum (zero point)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Where nothing comes in or goes out, only awareness; all manifestation comes from it (12.2, SD, NT)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Final hologram", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The new reality that comes out of the compression (12.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Illness (as frequency)", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "An energetic momentum carried from reality to reality by belief (12.4)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "DNA recall", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Letting consciousness lead you to the DNA fractal to stop and transform a frequency (12.4)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Contract", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The agreement that places you in an experience, e.g. to live it or to help (12.7, see 5.7)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Prana", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The energy of the quantum field, drawn in as your frequency rises (13.1)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "From the people up", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "New technology spreading by sharing and pooling, not sponsors (13.2, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Unity structure", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Life beyond competition for money, glory and fame (13.3)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Collective permission", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "The joy and wish for change that let benevolent help step in (13.4, DP)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Body as vessel", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Training the body to carry the energy field, so you shift by thought (13.5, SD)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Artificial timeline", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "A device-built, controlled hologram, outside the natural ascension (13.5)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Hide-and-seek", "url": "toolkit.html#key-words", "text": "Searching for what you know you already have (1.7)", "kind": "word"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "You are the structure; nobody is outside of you. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "What you send out — thought, emotion, deed — is what you get back. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Change your frequency, then hold it moment to moment. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Know it 100%; doubt and scripts of how block it. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Act, be grateful, accept any outcome. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Feel you already have everything — know it to see it. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Some things are lessons: accept them and pass with excellence. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Follow your passion — it's your higher self. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Which reality you pick is up to you. (1)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Pull out to zero point before you choose. (2)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "The outcome follows the emotion you hold most. (2)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Overwrite, never reject. (2)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Every moment is a new reality: don't carry the past. (2)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Speak in the now, and check heart against ego. (2)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "There is no white lie: be truthful, kindly. (3)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "The field delivers your more potent frequency, your true feeling. (3)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Your heart is your compass; don't judge. (3)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Words are frequencies: speak positively, from the heart. (3)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "A price is a condition; give from the heart and let people choose. (4)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Accept money, but never limit yourself to it. (4)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Be the abundance you want to see. (4)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Give from the heart as your currency. (5)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "A low state is a location: neutralize, then shift. (5)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Think through the structure, not the emotion. (5)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Believe humanity is changing. (5)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Let go of what you carry: forgive and start from zero. (6)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "You don't change others; you change yourself and shift. (6)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Lessons repeat until you let go 100%. (6)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Stop, transform, complete, then leave it alone. (7)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "You cannot go against creation. (7)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Never act from fear; act from the heart. (8)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Trust the heart's first impulse. (8)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Give what you have; giving doesn't require money. (9)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "It's resonance, not punishment. (9)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Heart-based exchange opens instant manifestation. (10)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Everything can change except a bylaw. (10)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Drop the details; know you have it; act; leave it open. (11)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Chasing someone reprints them; forgiveness lets them go. (11)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Neutralize into the vacuum, then project something potent. (12)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Don't judge; change comes from within, then act. (12)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Share what works; build together from the ground up. (13)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Principle", "url": "toolkit.html#principles", "text": "Benevolent help never overrides your consciousness. (13)", "kind": "principle"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Morning: give thanks for what you have; write what you love and choose the most exciting thing to act on.", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "When upset: run the Pull Out method (Section 1, Fig. D); for strong negatives, the Overwrite Protocol (Section 2, Fig. I).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "When the news or others tell you what will happen: \"That's their projection.\" Give gratitude, project what you choose (2.5).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Affirm in the now: \"I am\", \"I know\", never \"I will\" (2.9).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Before saying yes: run the Truth Check (Section 3). Kind honesty, no white lies.", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "After work: spend time on your passion and give something from the heart, with no condition (Section 4).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Feeling low: run Shift Your Location (Section 5): thank, neutralize, potent gratitude and action.", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Learning: study in short pieces of about 15 minutes, and rewatch (5.2).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "After a hard day: gratitude for why you were there, then something you enjoy; move your body (6.7).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "An old memory or belief returns: forgive, start from zero, replace it with a positive picture (6.6).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "In an argument or replay: Stop · Transform · Complete (Section 7).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Before a decision: the Heart Check: heart, fear or ego? (Section 8).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Feeling flat: an uplifting film, music that gives goosebumps, or a kindness for a stranger (8.13).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Money worry: \"I have everything I need.\" Give something non-monetary today (9.1).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Old memory replaying: Layer a New You (Section 9).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Wanting something specific: Leave It Open: strip the details, \"I have everything I need\", act (Section 11).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Someone keeps causing problems: neutralize and forgive; don't go after them (11.6).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Two realities pulling at you: Through the Vacuum: neutralize, project potently, act (Section 12).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Ill or in pain: see your doctor; use Stop · Transform · Complete alongside (12.4).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Choosing music: pick what lifts you; tones carry frequencies (12.5).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "New guidance or a new health idea: check it with research and a professional before acting (13.1).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Have something useful: share it; pool small amounts with others (13.2).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Watch your words: positive, from the heart (3.9).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "After a big shift (dizziness, nausea): rest, integrate, and check your body (3.7).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Forgot why you came in? Recall the last room's frequency (2.7).", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "With difficult people: kind tone, no judgment, accept the outcome.", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "When something is missing: know you have it, take action, watch for synchronicity.", "kind": "practice"}, {"s": 0, "title": "Daily practice", "url": "toolkit.html#daily-practice", "text": "Self-check: Am I doubting or scripting the how? Do my feelings match my words? Am I holding steady? Then what do I actually need right now?", "kind": "practice"}];
